    thinking: "**Developing Mobile Color Grading**\n\nI\'m focusing on the core color grading tools for the Android app. Currently, I\'m prioritizing LUT support, aiming for .cube files initially, with a focus on custom 3D LUTs and standard log profiles. After that, color wheels (Lift/Gamma/Gain/Offset) with tint and luminance sliders are next. Then comes curves, both RGB and Master/Custom, plus Hue vs Hue. The goal is to build powerful, yet intuitive, mobile color grading.\n\n\n"
