  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Clarifying The Approach**\n\nOkay, I\'m now clear on the interaction protocol. I\'ll be using the `ask_question` tool for interactive clarification, starting with multiple-choice questions. I understand the formatting requirements: plain text only, no extraneous characters or markup. I\'m focusing on those specific points.\n\n\n**Refining The Questions**\n\nI\'ve crafted three initial clarifying questions, focusing on the core aspects: video export workflow, workspace layout, and specific color grading controls. The options are concise and plain text, as requested. I\'ve also incorporated the recommendation prefix. I intend to yield after posing these questions, as specified, without generating any implementation plan at this stage.\n\n\n**Validating Question Structure**\n\nI\'ve carefully validated the question format to ensure it meets all requirements. Each option is concise, plain text, and under the word limit. I\'ve also verified the questions are clear and answerable. I\'m now fully confident in the structure and clarity.\n\n\n"
