    domain: "samsung.com"
    summary: "Official documentation and technical resources provided by Samsung (via the Samsung Developers portal) for the **Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra** Pro Video log profile detail the following specifications regarding its color space, gamma curve, and post-production workflow[1][2]:\n\n### 1. Gamma Curve (Log Profile)\n* **Gamma Profile:** **Samsung Log**\n* **Purpose:** Designed to mimic human visual characteristics by applying a specialized logarithmic gamma curve[3]. It compresses the dynamic range to maximize shadow detail (increasing data in darker areas) and preserve highlight roll-off, giving a flat, low-contrast image ideal for professional color grading[4][5][3].\n* **Codec:** Recorded using a **10-bit HEVC** container format in Pro Video mode[1].\n\n### 2. Color Space & Conversion\n* **Target Output / Standard Color Space:** **Rec. 709 / BT.709** (Standard color space for high-definition television and web distribution)[6][5].\n* **Official Support Files:** Samsung provides official conversion assets for desktop video editors (such as Adobe Premiere Pro and DaVinci Resolve) downloadable via the Samsung Developers portal[7][2]. These include:\n  * `Samsung Log to Linear 1DLUT_v1.0.cube`[1]\n  * `Samsung Log to Rec709 3DLUT_v1.0.cube`[1]\n  * `Samsung Log to CineLUT Rec709_v1.0.zip`[1]\n\n### 3. Monitoring & On-Device Tools\n* **In-Camera Preview LUTs:** While shooting in Pro Video mode with Samsung Log enabled, the camera allows you to toggle preview LUTs (such as *Blockbuster*, *Coming-of-age*, *Romance*, and *Thriller*)[1]. These apply a temporary Rec. 709 viewing look so you can evaluate framing, contrast, and skin tones in real time without baking the look permanently into the raw 10-bit log file[8]. \n* **Exposure Aids:** Features like Zebra patterns and False Color are supported within Pro Video mode to help properly expose flat log footage[1].\n\nSources:\n[1] [samsung.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFgS4fQCXEb6-MO1GY_J-SMTGkSh52XOCDsNYiEm2XNhcp2Hc55WugFd31UL2xVWEfKBYXJ5IwQOpQye5LEqGzQ6oiXeT722608BDq8FVHkQTfufviV86ZfnluynPPxUaQhIiYTVSN88iruXc4iPog0Tw==)\n[2] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFyRFtx8v5YdM5hoCtt5fBfnsrBJQWpB1y3_lomemrtQMrLSioiGdyJdeTPHDyshNxfWszjSc2Z-L_MGolioJg4byR-gkn3qxym2qpIvWdmZk64j_hGUn2k8b_TkbdTpJ54)\n[3] [samsung.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHcdxHE82FNmZzKCafEktkpqoOEI_FCvVsgTsC_TlPPQqY_osT00FrjoLlYUlow04aBtLYfy8xaDDGExChrdu6d07Xbn_jQCKge5vY3rhlYA42P2-qJRgBQ--Eq0faOs_UlyFTnNMnOx2Ar8gEDK1kYhbPNEKuP24W-Acn-kJCwbzVzyvFP9Q==)\n[4] [samsung.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEo6TMslXpQqqVaBK9r9pGgIfBczck6D65yarTDmsF51I92itAeA7JxnebCl0XJ1YMgLuEuaBvq5fmJTKtsIahvaDN5A82J9-6fp7PKOU9MXb0D4wOpJBKnvXG1YN_9vkDHntXmAHEJZD7KKIk=)\n[5] [epictutorials.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGLxFfqBGCZ78J4qeGIvRUxYNl4NbCTlnkBWt1Bld1Mv1F1_v5BvOGvxbI-xUK7Fqxomz3lDTxkEhPw308vCL1D0JYSJj6zKAX1ufhEPlsCGpt5E5SEVR4xy7Y25WLlzUEXATT-gG6nx0wBfBxB5wang9XgDgLP6v3prYYw5UXOea8a1TqiaV_ZVabnSA-nIIf8E_D_gCXTtEDCZBTCgRUPeTTLmZnO5yJ8Sg==)\n[6] [samsung.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFhHLEuEIdHWTiqosOXBX-qA7VTQJcdwIjto_PsQwh-yamvXFN3Cp2KPstJt0TixYahH3lwnp6fLzHywF4ks0AFqxp4acDtczMtdsinUFg5pmRLMY-g_7ZNsPpSdWObFUHpAUvZJg6BjRfRQXm56UfXzdBjRwvKmdTSabgkg28yLkPRdGIEkVNzIOB5IB4UWwrImj0=)\n[7] [reddit.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE2pHhn_clm6YFO_W5Bg52KsNc8j3HTjPUzi2Chq1c5ve65FJaHhdzxi2BjA1t9Tbk3QnpYcin5RyNBhO2IhmAZcXOqgr0vUwTe8aUwfha6fuRrkAOwnhS99h775U0nFOifR4o4Nul5K1B7dUkJnu7xYk4HGW9mVptIIt1xe6uUE4o1hAK1bOMUCyWwZGrhe8uNXi6X2142tLI=)\n[8] [samsung.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHsUJNRnf7W-sPcaGMBfiXiPdXlabWqyWtjV4rHQMe-oSLOAUupghQ7dV2gznop13KoIWu60pRTgbe_feZgLvjU2tjyjifPzAgzmmyLpa8uoYm9bbAboJBlose6P