            lines {
              text: "ResolveStudio is a mobile video color grading application inspired by DaVinci Resolve\'s Color Page, specifically tuned for processing Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra Pro Video 10-bit Log footage. It delivers professional-grade color science, real-time video playback with hardware-accelerated color grading, interactive primary wheels, RGB and Hue curves, power window masking, halation and grain effects, broadcast scopes (Waveform, Vectorscope, Histogram), and full MP4 video and .cube 3D LUT export."
