  planner_response {
    response: "ResolveStudio is built and ready, bringing a DaVinci Resolve-grade color suite to mobile, tuned for **Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra 10-bit Log 4K** footage:\n\n### What Was Built:\n- **Samsung Log Color Science**: Mathematical logarithmic de-compression with dynamic range expansion, highlight knee roll-off, tone mapping, and Rec.709 conversion.\n- **DaVinci Primary Color Wheels**: 4 tactile wheels for **Lift** (shadows), **Gamma** (midtones), **Gain** (highlights), and **Offset** (master balance) with fine-tune luminance sliders, reticle tracking, and double-tap reset.\n- **Custom Spline Curves**: Interactive 2D Cartesian curve canvas with draggable control knots and monotonic cubic splines across **Master Y**, **Red**, **Green**, and **Blue** channels.\n- **Broadcast Scopes Dock**: Real-time **RGB Waveform Parade**, **Vectorscope** with 123\302\260 skin-tone I-line and legal broadcast targets, and 256-bin **RGB Histogram**.\n- **Power Window Masking**: Radial/oval and linear gradient masks with continuous touch positioning, feather falloff, inversion, and visual preview canvas guides.\n- **Analog Film & Look FX**: Authentic film halation bloom on specular highlights, 35mm organic film grain, vignette, and white balance (temperature & tint).\n- **3D LUT Support**: Built-in Samsung Log transforms and cinematic print profiles, plus custom **`.cube` file import**.\n- **Export Pipeline**: Full **MP4 Video Renderer** (MediaCodec + MediaMuxer), uncompressed **Still Frame PNG** export, and standard **`.cube` 3D LUT export** compatible with desktop DaVinci Resolve and Premiere Pro.\n- **Playback & Scrubber**: 60fps timeline with frame-accurate timecode, A/B split-screen comparison wipe, and a dedicated **Hold to Bypass** button."
    modified_response: "ResolveStudio is built and ready, bringing a DaVinci Resolve-grade color suite to mobile, tuned for **Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra 10-bit Log 4K** footage:\n\n### What Was Built:\n- **Samsung Log Color Science**: Mathematical logarithmic de-compression with dynamic range expansion, highlight knee roll-off, tone mapping, and Rec.709 conversion.\n- **DaVinci Primary Color Wheels**: 4 tactile wheels for **Lift** (shadows), **Gamma** (midtones), **Gain** (highlights), and **Offset** (master balance) with fine-tune luminance sliders, reticle tracking, and double-tap reset.\n- **Custom Spline Curves**: Interactive 2D Cartesian curve canvas with draggable control knots and monotonic cubic splines across **Master Y**, **Red**, **Green**, and **Blue** channels.\n- **Broadcast Scopes Dock**: Real-time **RGB Waveform Parade**, **Vectorscope** with 123\302\260 skin-tone I-line and legal broadcast targets, and 256-bin **RGB Histogram**.\n- **Power Window Masking**: Radial/oval and linear gradient masks with continuous touch positioning, feather falloff, inversion, and visual preview canvas guides.\n- **Analog Film & Look FX**: Authentic film halation bloom on specular highlights, 35mm organic film grain, vignette, and white balance (temperature & tint).\n- **3D LUT Support**: Built-in Samsung Log transforms and cinematic print profiles, plus custom **`.cube` file import**.\n- **Export Pipeline**: Full **MP4 Video Renderer** (MediaCodec + MediaMuxer), uncompressed **Still Frame PNG** export, and standard **`.cube` 3D LUT export** compatible with desktop DaVinci Resolve and Premiere Pro.\n- **Playback & Scrubber**: 60fps timeline with frame-accurate timecode, A/B split-screen comparison wipe, and a dedicated **Hold to Bypass** button."
