  planner_response {
    response: "### ResolveStudio: DaVinci Resolve Color Grading Studio for Samsung S24 Ultra Log 4K\n\nResolveStudio has been built and verified. It brings desktop-class DaVinci Resolve color grading directly to Android mobile, specifically engineered for **Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra Pro Video 10-bit Log** footage.\n\n---\n\n### Core Capabilities:\n\n1. **Samsung Log Color Science Engine**:\n   - Native logarithmic decompression from Samsung Log gamma to linear HDR light.\n   - Dynamic tone mapping with Hermite highlight knee roll-off to retain specular highlight detail without clipping.\n   - Rec.709 color space transform matrix.\n\n2. **Primary Color Wheels (DaVinci Resolve Style)**:\n   - 4 tactile color wheels: **Lift** (shadows), **Gamma** (midtones), **Gain** (highlights), and **Offset** (master).\n   - Interactive reticle tracking on 360\302\260 color spectrum rings with fine-tune coordinates readout and double-tap to reset.\n   - Dedicated master horizontal luminance jog-wheel sliders beneath each trackball.\n\n3. **Custom Spline Curves Editor**:\n   - Interactive 2D Cartesian spline canvas with **Master Y**, **Red**, **Green**, and **Blue** channels.\n   - Monotonic cubic spline (Fritsch-Carlson) interpolation ensuring natural curves with no overshoot.\n   - Tap anywhere on the graph to insert knots; drag to reshape; select and delete individual points.\n\n4. **Live Broadcast Scopes**:\n   - **RGB Waveform Parade**: 3-column Red, Green, Blue parade with 0\342\200\223100 IRE broadcast lines.\n   - **Vectorscope**: Circular polar chroma wheel with an authentic 123\302\260 skin-tone I-line indicator and R, G, B, Cy, Mg, Yl target boxes.\n   - **RGB Histogram**: 256-bin overlaid frequency distribution.\n\n5. **Power Window Masking**:\n   - Radial / Oval and Linear Gradient power windows.\n   - Visual on-screen guide with draggable center, size/feather handles, and instant inversion toggle.\n\n6. **Analog Film & FX Rack**:\n   - **Halation Glow**: Warm red edge scattering around bright light sources, emulating 35mm film halation.\n   - **35mm Film Grain**: Organic procedural grain with intensity control.\n   - **Vignette**: Radial optical falloff with softness control.\n   - **White Balance**: Kelvin temperature (-100 to +100) and tint (-100 to +100).\n   - Exposure EV compensation (-2.0 to +2.0 EV), Contrast, and Saturation.\n\n7. **3D LUT Profiles**:\n   - Bundled looks: *Samsung Log to Rec.709*, *Samsung Cine Warm*, *Blockbuster Teal & Orange*, *Kodak 2383 Print*, and *Clean Commercial*.\n   - **Custom `.cube` Import**: Pick any `.cube` 3D LUT from device storage with variable opacity blending.\n\n8. **Export Pipeline**:\n   - **Master MP4 Video**: High-bitrate 4K/1080p H.264/HEVC encoding via `MediaCodec` and `MediaMuxer` with real-time frame progress.\n   - **Graded Still Frame (PNG)**: Full-resolution uncompressed frame export.\n   - **Desktop `.cube` 3D LUT**: Exports a 33\303\22733\303\22733 `.cube` file ready to load into desktop DaVinci Resolve or Premiere Pro.\n   - Instant Android system share sheet integration.\n\n9. **Playback & Scrubbing**:\n   - 60fps timeline with frame-accurate timecode (`00:00:00:00`).\n   - Play/pause, step 1 frame forward/backward.\n   - **A/B Split-Screen Wipe Slider** and **Hold to Bypass** button for instant comparison against raw flat log footage."
    modified_response: "### ResolveStudio: DaVinci Resolve Color Grading Studio for Samsung S24 Ultra Log 4K\n\nResolveStudio has been built and verified. It brings desktop-class DaVinci Resolve color grading directly to Android mobile, specifically engineered for **Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra Pro Video 10-bit Log** footage.\n\n---\n\n### Core Capabilities:\n\n1. **Samsung Log Color Science Engine**:\n   - Native logarithmic decompression from Samsung Log gamma to linear HDR light.\n   - Dynamic tone mapping with Hermite highlight knee roll-off to retain specular highlight detail without clipping.\n   - Rec.709 color space transform matrix.\n\n2. **Primary Color Wheels (DaVinci Resolve Style)**:\n   - 4 tactile color wheels: **Lift** (shadows), **Gamma** (midtones), **Gain** (highlights), and **Offset** (master).\n   - Interactive reticle tracking on 360\302\260 color spectrum rings with fine-tune coordinates readout and double-tap to reset.\n   - Dedicated master horizontal luminance jog-wheel sliders beneath each trackball.\n\n3. **Custom Spline Curves Editor**:\n   - Interactive 2D Cartesian spline canvas with **Master Y**, **Red**, **Green**, and **Blue** channels.\n   - Monotonic cubic spline (Fritsch-Carlson) interpolation ensuring natural curves with no overshoot.\n   - Tap anywhere on the graph to insert knots; drag to reshape; select and delete individual points.\n\n4. **Live Broadcast Scopes**:\n   - **RGB Waveform Parade**: 3-column Red, Green, Blue parade with 0\342\200\223100 IRE broadcast lines.\n   - **Vectorscope**: Circular polar chroma wheel with an authentic 123\302\260 skin-tone I-line indicator and R, G, B, Cy, Mg, Yl target boxes.\n   - **RGB Histogram**: 256-bin overlaid frequency distribution.\n\n5. **Power Window Masking**:\n   - Radial / Oval and Linear Gradient power windows.\n   - Visual on-screen guide with draggable center, size/feather handles, and instant inversion toggle.\n\n6. **Analog Film & FX Rack**:\n   - **Halation Glow**: Warm red edge scattering around bright light sources, emulating 35mm film halation.\n   - **35mm Film Grain**: Organic procedural grain with intensity control.\n   - **Vignette**: Radial optical falloff with softness control.\n   - **White Balance**: Kelvin temperature (-100 to +100) and tint (-100 to +100).\n   - Exposure EV compensation (-2.0 to +2.0 EV), Contrast, and Saturation.\n\n7. **3D LUT Profiles**:\n   - Bundled looks: *Samsung Log to Rec.709*, *Samsung Cine Warm*, *Blockbuster Teal & Orange*, *Kodak 2383 Print*, and *Clean Commercial*.\n   - **Custom `.cube` Import**: Pick any `.cube` 3D LUT from device storage with variable opacity blending.\n\n8. **Export Pipeline**:\n   - **Master MP4 Video**: High-bitrate 4K/1080p H.264/HEVC encoding via `MediaCodec` and `MediaMuxer` with real-time frame progress.\n   - **Graded Still Frame (PNG)**: Full-resolution uncompressed frame export.\n   - **Desktop `.cube` 3D LUT**: Exports a 33\303\22733\303\22733 `.cube` file ready to load into desktop DaVinci Resolve or Premiere Pro.\n   - Instant Android system share sheet integration.\n\n9. **Playback & Scrubbing**:\n   - 60fps timeline with frame-accurate timecode (`00:00:00:00`).\n   - Play/pause, step 1 frame forward/backward.\n   - **A/B Split-Screen Wipe Slider** and **Hold to Bypass** button for instant comparison against raw flat log footage."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
