  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining the UI Container**\n\nI\'m focusing on crafting a dedicated container for the UI studio dock. I\'m prioritizing the layout that will house essential tools: color wheels, curve editors, and real-time histogram/vectorscope components. I\'m envisioning a visually appealing and user-friendly design to streamline the workflow.\n\n\n**Designing the Studio Dock**\n\nI\'m now building a layout container component for the UI Studio Dock. I\'m aiming for a DaVinci Resolve-inspired color grading console with dual/split monitoring. I\'ve designed quick mode toggles, and compact mini scope strips for live updates. I\'m focusing on responsiveness, considering phone to tablet layouts with resizable and collapsible panes, as well as parameter readouts and dark studio styling. I\'ve started checking existing files.\n\n\n"
