  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Architecting the UI Layout**\n\nI\'m focusing on the Studio Dock Container, aiming for a modular and unified layout. I\'m visualizing the architecture for a layout container in `StudioDockContainer.kt`, thinking about how it will host the color wheels, curve editors, and real-time histogram/vectorscope components. The goal is a cohesive UI experience.\n\n\n**Defining Dock Container Modes**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the interaction model for the Studio Dock Container. I\'m prioritizing the split-pane functionality for dual-monitor setups, envisioning it as the core mode. This split view will allow for simultaneous interaction with color grading tools (wheels, curves) and real-time scopes. I\'m thinking through dock mode controls, creating the potential for expanded grading, or a dedicated full-screen scope monitor.\n\n\n**Designing Dock Container Components**\n\nI\'m now integrating interactive tool switching via a tab bar for Primaries, Curves, LUTs, Mask, and FX within the Studio Dock Container. I\'ve designed a quick parameter strip for real-time readouts of critical color values and a scope selector for switching between different visual scopes. I\'m ensuring seamless embedding of components like `ScopesView`, `ColorWheel`, `CurvesEditor`, and others. I\'m focusing on the component interfaces, and making sure that they accept the proper data, such as `Bitmap` for scopes, or `curves` data for the curves editor.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_9688373383584628982"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"package com.example.ui.components\\n\\nimport android.graphics.Bitmap\\nimport androidx.compose.animation.*\\nimport androidx.compose.foundation.background\\nimport androidx.compose.foundation.border\\nimport androidx.compose.foundation.clickable\\nimport androidx.compose.foundation.horizontalScroll\\nimport androidx.compose.foundation.layout.*\\nimport androidx.compose.foundation.rememberScrollState\\nimport androidx.compose.foundation.shape.RoundedCornerShape\\nimport androidx.compose.material.icons.Icons\\nimport androidx.compose.material.icons.filled.*\\nimport androidx.compose.material3.*\\nimport androidx.compose.runtime.*\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.Alignment\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.Modifier\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.draw.clip\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.graphics.Color\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.graphics.vector.ImageVector\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.platform.testTag\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.text.font.FontFamily\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.text.font.FontWeight\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.unit.dp\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.unit.sp\\nimport com.example.model.*\\nimport com.example.ui.theme.*\\n\\nenum class DockMonitorMode(val label: String, val icon: ImageVector) {\\n    SPLIT_SCOPE(\\\"Scope + Tool\\\", Icons.Default.ViewAgenda),\\n    FULL_TOOL(\\\"Full Tool\\\", Icons.Default.Fullscreen),\\n    FULL_SCOPES(\\\"Full Scopes\\\", Icons.Default.Equalizer)\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * A dedicated DaVinci Resolve-inspired layout container for the UI Studio Dock.\\n * Hosts and coordinates the primary color wheels, spline curve editors,\\n * and live broadcast scopes (histogram, vectorscope, RGB waveform parade).\\n */\\n@Composable\\nfun StudioDockContainer(\\n    activeTab: StudioToolTab,\\n    onTabSelected: (StudioToolTab) -> Unit,\\n    settings: ColorGradeSettings,\\n    onSettingsChange: ((ColorGradeSettings) -> ColorGradeSettings) -> Unit,\\n    previewBitmap: Bitmap?,\\n    onImportCubeClick: () -> Unit,\\n    modifier: Modifier = Modifier\\n) {\\n    var monitorMode by remember { mutableStateOf(DockMonitorMode.SPLIT_SCOPE) }\\n    var activeScopeMode by remember { mutableStateOf(ScopeMode.VECTORSCOPE) }\\n\\n    Card(\\n        modifier = modifier\\n            .fillMaxWidth()\\n            .testTag(\\\"studio_dock_container\\\")\\n            .padding(horizontal = 6.dp, vertical = 4.dp),\\n        colors = CardDefaults.cardColors(containerColor = StudioSurface),\\n        shape = RoundedCornerShape(14.dp),\\n        border = CardDefaults.outlinedCardBorder().copy(brush = androidx.compose.ui.graphics.SolidColor(StudioCardBorder))\\n    ) {\\n        Column(\\n            modifier = Modifier\\n                .fillMaxWidth()\\n                .padding(8.dp)\\n        ) {\\n            // ==========================================\\n            // 1. DOCK HEADER CONSOLE BAR\\n            // ==========================================\\n            Row(\\n                verticalAlignment = Alignment.CenterVertically,\\n                horizontalArrangement = Arrangement.SpaceBetween,\\n                modifier = Modifier\\n                    .fillMaxWidth()\\n                    .clip(RoundedCornerShape(8.dp))\\n                    .background(Color(0xFF0F1218))\\n                    .padding(horizontal = 10.dp, vertical = 6.dp)\\n            ) {\\n                // Title & Active Mode Badge\\n                Row(verticalAlignment = Alignment.CenterVertically) {\\n                    Icon(\\n                        imageVector = Icons.Default.Tune,\\n                        contentDescription = null,\\n                        tint = ResolveAmber,\\n                        modifier = Modifier.size(16.dp)\\n                    )\\n                    Spacer(modifier = Modifier.width(6.dp))\\n                    Text(\\n                        text = \\\"STUDIO DOCK\\\",\\n                        color = TextPrimary,\\n                        fontSize = 11.sp,\\n                        fontWeight = FontWeight.Black,\\n                        letterSpacing = 1.sp\\n                    )\\n\\n                    Spacer(modifier = Modifier.width(8.dp))\\n\\n                    // Channel Readout Pill\\n                    Box(\\n                        modifier = Modifier\\n                            .clip(RoundedCornerShape(4.dp))\\n                            .background(Color(0xFF1F2634))\\n                            .padding(horizontal = 6.dp, vertical = 2.dp)\\n                    ) {\\n                        Text(\\n                            text = when (activeTab) {\\n                                StudioToolTab.WHEELS -> \\\"PRIMARY WHEELS\\\"\\n                                StudioToolTab.CURVES -> \\\"CUSTOM SPLINES\\\"\\n                                StudioToolTab.LUTS -> \\\"3D LUTS\\\"\\n                                StudioToolTab.MASK -> \\\"POWER WINDOW\\\"\\n                                StudioToolTab.EFFECTS -> \\\"FILM LOOK & FX\\\"\\n                            },\\n                            color = ResolveAmber,\\n                            fontSize = 8.5.sp,\\n                            fontWeight = FontWeight.Bold,\\n                            fontFamily = FontFamily.Monospace\\n                        )\\n                    }\\n                }\\n\\n                // Scope & Tool Monitor View Toggles\\n                Row(\\n                    modifier = Modifier\\n                        .clip(RoundedCornerShape(6.dp))\\n                        .background(Color(0xFF171B24))\\n                        .padding(2.dp)\\n                ) {\\n                    DockMonitorMode.values().forEach { mode ->\\n                        val isSelected = monitorMode == mode\\n                        Box(\\n                            modifier = Modifier\\n                                .clip(RoundedCornerShape(4.dp))\\n                                .background(if (isSelected) ResolveAmber.copy(alpha = 0.22f) else Color.Transparent)\\n                                .clickable { monitorMode = mode }\\n                                .padding(horizontal = 7.dp, vertical = 4.dp)\\n                                .testTag(\\\"dock_monitor_mode_${mode.name.lowercase()}\\\"),\\n                            contentAlignment = Alignment.Center\\n                        ) {\\n                            Row(verticalAlignment = Alignment.CenterVertically) {\\n                                Icon(\\n                                    imageVector = mode.icon,\\n                                    contentDescription = mode.label,\\n                                    tint = if (isSelected) ResolveAmber else TextMuted,\\n                                    modifier = Modifier.size(13.dp)\\n                                )\\n                                Spacer(modifier = Modifier.width(4.dp))\\n                                Text(\\n                                    text = mode.label,\\n                                    color = if (isSelected) ResolveAmber else TextSecondary,\\n                                    fontSize = 9.sp,\\n                                    fontWeight = if (isSelected) FontWeight.Bold else FontWeight.Normal\\n                                )\\n                            }\\n                        }\\n                    }\\n                }\\n            }\\n\\n            Spacer(modifier = Modifier.height(6.dp))\\n\\n            // ==========================================\\n            // 2. REAL-TIME SCOPE MONITOR STRIP\\n            // (Visible in SPLIT_SCOPE and FULL_SCOPES modes)\\n            // ==========================================\\n            AnimatedVisibility(\\n                visible = monitorMode == DockMonitorMode.SPLIT_SCOPE || monitorMode == DockMonitorMode.FULL_SCOPES,\\n                enter = expandVertically() + fadeIn(),\\n                exit = shrinkVertically() + fadeOut()\\n            ) {\\n                Column(modifier = Modifier.fillMaxWidth().padding(bottom = 6.dp)) {\\n                    // Scope Channel Selector Bar\\n                    Row(\\n                        verticalAlignment = Alignment.CenterVertically,\\n                        horizontalArrangement = Arrangement.SpaceBetween,\\n                        modifier = Modifier\\n                            .fillMaxWidth()\\n                            .padding(horizontal = 4.dp, vertical = 2.dp)\\n                    ) {\\n                        Text(\\n                            text = \\\"LIVE VIDEO ANALYSIS\\\",\\n                            color = TextMuted,\\n                            fontSize = 9.sp,\\n                            fontWeight = FontWeight.Bold,\\n                            letterSpacing = 0.5.sp\\n                        )\\n\\n                        Row(\\n                            modifier = Modifier\\n                                .clip(RoundedCornerShape(4.dp))\\n                                .background(Color(0xFF10131B))\\n                                .padding(1.dp)\\n                        ) {\\n                            ScopeMode.values().forEach { sMode ->\\n                                val isSelected = activeScopeMode == sMode\\n                                Box(\\n                                    modifier = Modifier\\n                                        .clip(RoundedCornerShape(3.dp))\\n                                        .background(if (isSelected) ResolveCyan.copy(alpha = 0.25f) else Color.Transparent)\\n                                        .clickable { activeScopeMode = sMode }\\n                                        .padding(horizontal = 6.dp, vertical = 2.dp)\\n                                        .testTag(\\\"dock_scope_selector_${sMode.name.lowercase()}\\\"),\\n                                    contentAlignment = Alignment.Center\\n                                ) {\\n                                    Text(\\n                                        text = when (sMode) {\\n                                            ScopeMode.WAVEFORM_PARADE -> \\\"Parade\\\"\\n                                            ScopeMode.VECTORSCOPE -> \\\"Vectorscope\\\"\\n                                            ScopeMode.HISTOGRAM -> \\\"Histogram\\\"\\n                                        },\\n                                        color = if (isSelected) ResolveCyan else TextMuted,\\n                                        fontSize = 8.5.sp,\\n                                        fontWeight = if (isSelected) FontWeight.Bold else FontWeight.Normal\\n                                    )\\n                                }\\n                            }\\n                        }\\n                    }\\n\\n                    Spacer(modifier = Modifier.height(4.dp))\\n\\n                    // Scope Display Frame\\n                    Box(\\n                        modifier = Modifier\\n                            .fillMaxWidth()\\n                            .height(if (monitorMode == DockMonitorMode.FULL_SCOPES) 160.dp else 110.dp)\\n                            .clip(RoundedCornerShape(8.dp))\\n                            .background(Color(0xFF090B0E))\\n                            .border(1.dp, Color(0xFF1C2230), RoundedCornerShape(8.dp)),\\n                        contentAlignment = Alignment.Center\\n                    ) {\\n                        if (previewBitmap == null) {\\n                            Text(\\\"Awaiting live signal...\\\", color = TextMuted, fontSize = 10.sp)\\n                        } else {\\n                            when (activeScopeMode) {\\n                                ScopeMode.WAVEFORM_PARADE -> WaveformParadeCanvas(previewBitmap)\\n                                ScopeMode.VECTORSCOPE -> VectorscopeCanvas(previewBitmap)\\n                                ScopeMode.HISTOGRAM -> HistogramCanvas(previewBitmap)\\n                            }\\n                        }\\n                    }\\n                }\\n            }\\n\\n            // ==========================================\\n            // 3. COLOR GRADING TOOLS SECTION\\n            // (Visible in SPLIT_SCOPE and FULL_TOOL modes)\\n            // ==========================================\\n            AnimatedVisibility(\\n                visible = monitorMode != DockMonitorMode.FULL_SCOPES,\\n                enter = expandVertically() + fadeIn(),\\n                exit = shrinkVertically() + fadeOut()\\n            ) {\\n                Column(modifier = Modifier.fillMaxWidth()) {\\n                    when (activeTab) {\\n                        StudioToolTab.WHEELS -> {\\n                            // Primary Color Wheels Deck\\n                            Column(modifier = Modifier.fillMaxWidth()) {\\n                                Row(\\n                                    horizontalArrangement = Arrangement.SpaceBetween,\\n                                    verticalAlignment = Alignment.CenterVertically,\\n                                    modifier = Modifier\\n                                        .fillMaxWidth()\\n                                        .padding(horizontal = 4.dp, vertical = 2.dp)\\n                                ) {\\n                                    Text(\\n                                        text = \\\"3-WAY COLOR WHEELS & OFFSET\\\",\\n                                        color = TextPrimary,\\n                                        fontSize = 10.sp,\\n                                        fontWeight = FontWeight.Bold,\\n                                        letterSpacing = 0.5.sp\\n                                    )\\n                                    Text(\\n                                        text = \\\"Lift \342\200\242 Gamma \342\200\242 Gain \342\200\242 Offset\\\",\\n                                        color = TextMuted,\\n                                        fontSize = 8.5.sp,\\n                                        fontFamily = FontFamily.Monospace\\n                                    )\\n                                }\\n\\n                                Spacer(modifier = Modifier.height(2.dp))\\n\\n                                // Horizontal scrolling row of the 4 color wheels\\n                                Row(\\n                                    modifier = Modifier\\n                                        .fillMaxWidth()\\n                                        .horizontalScroll(rememberScrollState())\\n                                        .padding(vertical = 2.dp)\\n                                ) {\\n                                    ColorWheel(\\n                                        title = \\\"Lift\\\",\\n                                        accentColor = WheelLiftColor,\\n                                        value = settings.lift,\\n                                        onValueChange = { newLift -> onSettingsChange { it.copy(lift = newLift) } },\\n                                        modifier = Modifier.width(155.dp)\\n                                    )\\n\\n                                    ColorWheel(\\n                                        title = \\\"Gamma\\\",\\n                                        accentColor = WheelGammaColor,\\n                                        value = settings.gamma,\\n                                        onValueChange = { newGamma -> onSettingsChange { it.copy(gamma = newGamma) } },\\n                                        modifier = Modifier.width(155.dp)\\n                                    )\\n\\n                                    ColorWheel(\\n                                        title = \\\"Gain\\\",\\n                                        accentColor = WheelGainColor,\\n                                        value = settings.gain,\\n                                        onValueChange = { newGain -> onSettingsChange { it.copy(gain = newGain) } },\\n                                        modifier = Modifier.width(155.dp)\\n                                    )\\n\\n                                    ColorWheel(\\n                                        title = \\\"Offset\\\",\\n                                        accentColor = WheelOffsetColor,\\n                                        value = settings.offset,\\n                                        onValueChange = { newOffset -> onSettingsChange { it.copy(offset = newOffset) } },\\n                                        modifier = Modifier.width(155.dp)\\n                                    )\\n                                }\\n                            }\\n                        }\\n\\n                        StudioToolTab.CURVES -> {\\n                            // Custom Spline Curves Editor Canvas\\n                            CurvesEditor(\\n                                curves = settings.curves,\\n                                onCurvesChange = { newCurves -> onSettingsChange { it.copy(curves = newCurves) } },\\n                                modifier = Modifier.fillMaxWidth()\\n                            )\\n                        }\\n\\n                        StudioToolTab.LUTS -> {\\n                            // 3D LUT Browser & .cube Importer\\n                            LutPresetBrowser(\\n                                selectedLut = settings.activeLut,\\n                                lutIntensity = settings.lutIntensity,\\n                                onLutChange = { newLut -> onSettingsChange { it.copy(activeLut = newLut) } },\\n                                onIntensityChange = { newInt -> onSettingsChange { it.copy(lutIntensity = newInt) } },\\n                                onImportCubeClick = onImportCubeClick,\\n                                modifier = Modifier.fillMaxWidth()\\n                            )\\n                        }\\n\\n                        StudioToolTab.MASK -> {\\n                            // Power Window Masking Controls\\n                            PowerWindowControls(\\n                                mask = settings.mask,\\n                                onMaskChange = { newMask -> onSettingsChange { it.copy(mask = newMask) } },\\n                                modifier = Modifier.fillMaxWidth()\\n                            )\\n                        }\\n\\n                        StudioToolTab.EFFECTS -> {\\n                            // Halation, Film Grain, Vignette, White Balance, Samsung Log Knee\\n                            EffectsPanel(\\n                                settings = settings,\\n                                onSettingsChange = { newSettings -> onSettingsChange { newSettings } },\\n                                modifier = Modifier.fillMaxWidth()\\n                            )\\n                        }\\n                    }\\n                }\\n            }\\n\\n            Spacer(modifier = Modifier.height(6.dp))\\n\\n            // ==========================================\\n            // 4. STUDIO DOCK TOOL SELECTOR TABS\\n            // ==========================================\\n            Row(\\n                verticalAlignment = Alignment.CenterVertically,\\n                horizontalArrangement = Arrangement.SpaceEvenly,\\n                modifier = Modifier\\n                    .fillMaxWidth()\\n                    .clip(RoundedCornerShape(8.dp))\\n                    .background(Color(0xFF10131B))\\n                    .padding(3.dp)\\n            ) {\\n                StudioToolTab.values().forEach { tab ->\\n                    val isSelected = activeTab == tab\\n                    Box(\\n                        modifier = Modifier\\n                            .weight(1f)\\n                            .clip(RoundedCornerShape(6.dp))\\n                            .background(if (isSelected) ResolveAmber.copy(alpha = 0.2f) else Color.Transparent)\\n                            .clickable { onTabSelected(tab) }\\n                            .padding(vertical = 6.dp)\\n                            .testTag(\\\"dock_container_tab_${tab.name.lowercase()}\\\"),\\n                        contentAlignment = Alignment.Center\\n                    ) {\\n                        Column(horizontalAlignment = Alignment.CenterHorizontally) {\\n                            Icon(\\n                                imageVector = tab.icon,\\n                                contentDescription = tab.title,\\n                                tint = if (isSelected) ResolveAmber else TextMuted,\\n                                modifier = Modifier.size(16.dp)\\n                            )\\n                            Spacer(modifier = Modifier.height(2.dp))\\n                            Text(\\n                                text = tab.title,\\n                                color = if (isSelected) ResolveAmber else TextSecondary,\\n                                fontSize = 8.5.sp,\\n                                fontWeight = if (isSelected) FontWeight.Bold else FontWeight.Normal\\n                            )\\n                        }\\n                    }\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\",\"Description\":\"Create StudioDockContainer.kt as a dedicated layout container hosting color wheels, curves, and real-time scopes with split/full monitoring modes\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"TargetFile\":\"/app/src/main/java/com/example/ui/components/StudioDockContainer.kt\",\"toolAction\":\"Writing StudioDockContainer.kt\",\"toolSummary\":\"Create UI studio dock container component\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\270\027\n\265\027\001i\024}\023\364\364Bz7\v$\353\'\221e%!\3366\302\313oe\355\252\356\r\320G2\302\\\332\333\221\332I\211\241R\343u\244\003\334I\005\022\244\006w\316\002m\350\243QQI\245\361\267\250\225\374\267\302D\357$\341s \2454j\316a\nLo\215\332\355^\026@\271\253@\t}y\204 @\266@1\252\224\225\n\310\364I\2501\265\036\201\032\352\200\216\027\311v\360Y\246\223:\022N\017\205\313t\202\005o\374w\304W\243\005\220j\367\373\372\252uWe\205\354\2107-\234\367S\347wTr\330\\L\223\250#\r\030\004\363x\201\244\255b\333\241\375\225N\345m@\234\356\214\207\242*:\035\333I\242\t\022wM\307\364\332\365\245*\r|\177c\017d\263;P\262\3177\017\225?\336} \026\034$Z\'\204\304\301\306t\n\343\350FE\313\036o5\336\2238\262o\233GY\037/\332\314\377\370\214\204\344\034\212;\242OX^\025j\352\226?\346\326\340\304^eq\252\034\277\344\207\360\247A\3750\"\n\373`\370\272\233\227\247]\331\243\327-\244d\216\2721\253\221\177\227\253\226\325S\210x\026\026\207\030m[b\374h\345\264\340\224\360\032\360\356\330\336\002T}\322HM/g\347\202\245}~\305\217\272\245S\236C\227u\321\277\0267A\362Rk\350\223\324\301I%\235\201x\374\005\257\r\315\203EZ\032\371hNv\355@\310XY>\340\225\201x\005\355I& \0244G\006\224\347\342?\263\031\311\3054\364\023\213v?\340K\373|%e\252o\317\232!$-\350\351\267\2677]fbgvP\353\337\362;\370Ys\301g\bz\313\264X4b\324T\375z\345\207\016\245\211\a\246x\265\344\213\202k\245\200=Gsv\377q\',\311\370\323\226;iR\310q>d\220\a\346R\0231\250\236:\0302A(\332S\337\313;\322\365\204i\036\340\002w:4q\376N\322\316\276\335p\210+\362iO\217\242\303\006;n\r\223\253$\215-\353\246b-\377\266\213\036\253\177\306/\227\323\312\274\360\347\0318K\023\220\324\3175\t\225srmA\022\266\264\236^X\224h=\273\31572\342\326b\323HGQ\324\207-\201M\"y\346g\363\355\265\334\254W\210\266\311\360\255\315,=\240`\004\214qM\267\364\353\ax\241\312\215\374B=\311\000\332\200\243~_\224\210\346\200\245o\303\226\336\347\247dX\316\330A\357\353\274Z\322\324\025[:\n\177\216\020.\366J\340\000\247\'\002]o\344\371P\341r\0308\224\355\23