  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Studio Dock**\n\nI\'ve encapsulated the studio dock hosting within `StudioDockContainer`. This container now houses all the essential color grading tools: color wheels for lift, gamma, gain, and offset; curve editors for master, red, green, and blue splines. Real-time visualization is provided by a histogram, vectorscope, and waveform parade, all accessible through three live monitoring modes.\n\n\n"
