    thinking: "**Designing ColorWheel Component**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the feasibility of a reusable `ColorWheel` component in Jetpack Compose, specifically for modifying lift, gamma, and gain values. I\'m exploring visual feedback mechanisms for hue and saturation, considering its application to high-bitrate video.\n\n\n"
