  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing the Overlay Component**\n\nI\'m currently focused on building `MaskingOverlay.kt` within the UI components. This overlay, placed above the video preview, will be an interactive canvas, with the key functionality being to detect touch interactions, particularly if they hit a central reticle.\n\n\n**Defining Power Window Controls**\n\nI\'ve been designing the interactive controls for the power window. Now I\'m focusing on user interactions, and the different power window shapes. I\'m supporting elliptical, rectangular, and linear shapes. I\'m planning to let users draw and position the power window directly over the video. I\'m also planning to incorporate a floating control strip on the overlay. The strip will have a shape selector, invert toggle, matte mode toggle, and feather & corner radius sliders.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_4130281957598920217"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"package com.example.ui.components\\n\\nimport androidx.compose.foundation.Canvas\\nimport androidx.compose.foundation.background\\nimport androidx.compose.foundation.gestures.detectDragGestures\\nimport androidx.compose.foundation.gestures.detectTapGestures\\nimport androidx.compose.foundation.layout.*\\nimport androidx.compose.foundation.shape.CircleShape\\nimport androidx.compose.foundation.shape.RoundedCornerShape\\nimport androidx.compose.material.icons.Icons\\nimport androidx.compose.material.icons.filled.*\\nimport androidx.compose.material3.*\\nimport androidx.compose.runtime.*\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.Alignment\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.Modifier\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.draw.clip\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.geometry.CornerRadius\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.geometry.Offset\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.geometry.Size\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.graphics.Color\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.graphics.PathEffect\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.graphics.drawscope.Stroke\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.input.pointer.pointerInput\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.platform.testTag\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.text.font.FontWeight\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.unit.dp\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.unit.sp\\nimport com.example.model.MaskType\\nimport com.example.model.PowerWindowMask\\nimport com.example.ui.theme.*\\nimport kotlin.math.*\\n\\nprivate enum class DragHandle {\\n    CENTER,\\n    HANDLE_TOP,\\n    HANDLE_BOTTOM,\\n    HANDLE_LEFT,\\n    HANDLE_RIGHT,\\n    HANDLE_TOP_LEFT,\\n    HANDLE_TOP_RIGHT,\\n    HANDLE_BOTTOM_LEFT,\\n    HANDLE_BOTTOM_RIGHT,\\n    NONE\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Interactive \'MaskingOverlay\' component placed directly over the video preview.\\n * Allows drawing, resizing, feathering, and repositioning elliptical and rectangular\\n * power windows for localized color grading (DaVinci Resolve style).\\n */\\n@Composable\\nfun MaskingOverlay(\\n    mask: PowerWindowMask,\\n    onMaskChange: (PowerWindowMask) -> Unit,\\n    modifier: Modifier = Modifier\\n) {\\n    if (mask.type == MaskType.NONE) return\\n\\n    var activeHandle by remember { mutableStateOf(DragHandle.NONE) }\\n    var showQuickToolbar by remember { mutableStateOf(true) }\\n\\n    Box(\\n        modifier = modifier\\n            .fillMaxSize()\\n            .pointerInput(mask) {\\n                detectTapGestures(\\n                    onDoubleTap = {\\n                        // Reset mask to default center\\n                        onMaskChange(mask.copy(centerX = 0.5f, centerY = 0.5f, radiusX = 0.3f, radiusY = 0.3f))\\n                    },\\n                    onTap = {\\n                        showQuickToolbar = !showQuickToolbar\\n                    }\\n                )\\n            }\\n            .pointerInput(mask) {\\n                detectDragGestures(\\n                    onDragStart = { startOffset ->\\n                        val w = size.width.toFloat()\\n                        val h = size.height.toFloat()\\n                        val cx = mask.centerX * w\\n                        val cy = mask.centerY * h\\n                        val rx = mask.radiusX * w\\n                        val ry = mask.radiusY * h\\n                        val hitRadius = 28.dp.toPx()\\n\\n                        // Check handles\\n                        fun isHit(px: Float, py: Float) =\\n                            sqrt((startOffset.x - px).pow(2) + (startOffset.y - py).pow(2)) < hitRadius\\n\\n                        activeHandle = when {\\n                            isHit(cx, cy - ry) -> DragHandle.HANDLE_TOP\\n                            isHit(cx, cy + ry) -> DragHandle.HANDLE_BOTTOM\\n                            isHit(cx - rx, cy) -> DragHandle.HANDLE_LEFT\\n                            isHit(cx + rx, cy) -> DragHandle.HANDLE_RIGHT\\n                            isHit(cx - rx, cy - ry) -> DragHandle.HANDLE_TOP_LEFT\\n                            isHit(cx + rx, cy - ry) -> DragHandle.HANDLE_TOP_RIGHT\\n                            isHit(cx - rx, cy + ry) -> DragHandle.HANDLE_BOTTOM_LEFT\\n                            isHit(cx + rx, cy + ry) -> DragHandle.HANDLE_BOTTOM_RIGHT\\n                            isHit(cx, cy) -> DragHandle.CENTER\\n                            // If clicked inside the shape, drag center\\n                            (startOffset.x - cx).pow(2) / rx.pow(2) + (startOffset.y - cy).pow(2) / ry.pow(2) <= 1.0f ->\\n                                DragHandle.CENTER\\n                            else -> DragHandle.CENTER\\n                        }\\n                    },\\n                    onDragEnd = { activeHandle = DragHandle.NONE },\\n                    onDragCancel = { activeHandle = DragHandle.NONE }\\n                ) { change, dragAmount ->\\n                    change.consume()\\n                    val w = size.width.toFloat()\\n                    val h = size.height.toFloat()\\n                    val dx = dragAmount.x / w\\n                    val dy = dragAmount.y / h\\n\\n                    when (activeHandle) {\\n                        DragHandle.CENTER -> {\\n                            val newCx = (mask.centerX + dx).coerceIn(0.05f, 0.95f)\\n                            val newCy = (mask.centerY + dy).coerceIn(0.05f, 0.95f)\\n                            onMaskChange(mask.copy(centerX = newCx, centerY = newCy))\\n                        }\\n                        DragHandle.HANDLE_RIGHT -> {\\n                            val newRx = (mask.radiusX + dx).coerceIn(0.05f, 0.5f)\\n                            onMaskChange(mask.copy(radiusX = newRx))\\n                        }\\n                        DragHandle.HANDLE_LEFT -> {\\n                            val newRx = (mask.radiusX - dx).coerceIn(0.05f, 0.5f)\\n                            onMaskChange(mask.copy(radiusX = newRx))\\n                        }\\n                        DragHandle.HANDLE_BOTTOM -> {\\n                            val newRy = (mask.radiusY + dy).coerceIn(0.05f, 0.5f)\\n                            onMaskChange(mask.copy(radiusY = newRy))\\n                        }\\n                        DragHandle.HANDLE_TOP -> {\\n                            val newRy = (mask.radiusY - dy).coerceIn(0.05f, 0.5f)\\n                            onMaskChange(mask.copy(radiusY = newRy))\\n                        }\\n                        DragHandle.HANDLE_TOP_RIGHT, DragHandle.HANDLE_BOTTOM_RIGHT,\\n                        DragHandle.HANDLE_TOP_LEFT, DragHandle.HANDLE_BOTTOM_LEFT -> {\\n                            // Scale both axes\\n                            val scaleDelta = (dx + dy) / 2f\\n                            val newRx = (mask.radiusX + dx).coerceIn(0.05f, 0.5f)\\n                            val newRy = (mask.radiusY + dy).coerceIn(0.05f, 0.5f)\\n                            onMaskChange(mask.copy(radiusX = newRx, radiusY = newRy))\\n                        }\\n                        DragHandle.NONE -> {}\\n                    }\\n                }\\n            }\\n    ) {\\n        // ==========================================\\n        // 1. CANVAS: Elliptical / Rectangular Guides\\n        // ==========================================\\n        Canvas(modifier = Modifier.fillMaxSize()) {\\n            val w = size.width\\n            val h = size.height\\n            val cx = mask.centerX * w\\n            val cy = mask.centerY * h\\n            val rx = mask.radiusX * w\\n            val ry = mask.radiusY * h\\n\\n            when (mask.type) {\\n                MaskType.ELLIPTICAL -> {\\n                    // Main solid boundary ellipse\\n                    drawOval(\\n                        color = ResolveAmber,\\n                        topLeft = Offset(cx - rx, cy - ry),\\n                        size = Size(rx * 2f, ry * 2f),\\n                        style = Stroke(width = 2.dp.toPx())\\n                    )\\n\\n                    // Feather boundary (outer dashed ellipse)\\n                    val featherRx = rx * (1f + mask.feather)\\n                    val featherRy = ry * (1f + mask.feather)\\n                    drawOval(\\n                        color = ResolveCyan.copy(alpha = 0.65f),\\n                        topLeft = Offset(cx - featherRx, cy - featherRy),\\n                        size = Size(featherRx * 2f, featherRy * 2f),\\n                        style = Stroke(\\n                            width = 1.2.dp.toPx(),\\n                            pathEffect = PathEffect.dashPathEffect(floatArrayOf(6f, 6f))\\n                        )\\n                    )\\n\\n                    // 4 Quadrant Sizing Handles (East, West, North, South)\\n                    val handles = listOf(\\n                        Offset(cx + rx, cy),\\n                        Offset(cx - rx, cy),\\n                        Offset(cx, cy - ry),\\n                        Offset(cx, cy + ry)\\n                    )\\n                    for (handle in handles) {\\n                        drawCircle(color = ResolveAmber, radius = 5.dp.toPx(), center = handle)\\n                        drawCircle(color = Color.White, radius = 2.5.dp.toPx(), center = handle)\\n                    }\\n\\n                    // 4 Corner Diagonal Handles\\n                    val diagOffset = 0.7071f\\n                    val cornerHandles = listOf(\\n                        Offset(cx + rx * diagOffset, cy - ry * diagOffset),\\n                        Offset(cx + rx * diagOffset, cy + ry * diagOffset),\\n                        Offset(cx - rx * diagOffset, cy - ry * diagOffset),\\n                        Offset(cx - rx * diagOffset, cy + ry * diagOffset)\\n                    )\\n                    for (cHandle in cornerHandles) {\\n                        drawRect(\\n                            color = ResolveCyan,\\n                            topLeft = Offset(cHandle.x - 3.5.dp.toPx(), cHandle.y - 3.5.dp.toPx()),\\n                            size = Size(7.dp.toPx(), 7.dp.toPx())\\n                        )\\n                    }\\n\\n                    // Center Crosshair Reticle\\n                    drawCircle(color = ResolveAmber, radius = 4.dp.toPx(), center = Offset(cx, cy))\\n                    drawLine(color = ResolveAmber, start = Offset(cx - 10.dp.toPx(), cy), end = Offset(cx + 10.dp.toPx(), cy), strokeWidth = 1.5.dp.toPx())\\n                    drawLine(color = ResolveAmber, start = Offset(cx, cy - 10.dp.toPx()), end = Offset(cx, cy + 10.dp.toPx()), strokeWidth = 1.5.dp.toPx())\\n                }\\n\\n                MaskType.RECTANGULAR -> {\\n                    // Main solid boundary rectangle\\n                    drawRoundRect(\\n                        color = ResolveAmber,\\n                        topLeft = Offset(cx - rx, cy - ry),\\n                        size = Size(rx * 2f, ry * 2f),\\n                        cornerRadius = CornerRadius(8.dp.toPx(), 8.dp.toPx()),\\n                        style = Stroke(width = 2.dp.toPx())\\n                    )\\n\\n                    // Feather boundary (outer dashed rectangle)\\n                    val featherRx = rx * (1f + mask.feather)\\n                    val featherRy = ry * (1f + mask.feather)\\n                    drawRoundRect(\\n                        color = ResolveCyan.copy(alpha = 0.65f),\\n                        topLeft = Offset(cx - featherRx, cy - featherRy),\\n                        size = Size(featherRx * 2f, featherRy * 2f),\\n                        cornerRadius = CornerRadius(10.dp.toPx(), 10.dp.toPx()),\\n                        style = Stroke(\\n                            width = 1.2.dp.toPx(),\\n                            pathEffect = PathEffect.dashPathEffect(floatArrayOf(6f, 6f))\\n                        )\\n                    )\\n\\n                    // 4 Corner Sizing Handles\\n                    val corners = listOf(\\n                        Offset(cx - rx, cy - ry),\\n                        Offset(cx + rx, cy - ry),\\n                        Offset(cx - rx, cy + ry),\\n                        Offset(cx + rx, cy + ry)\\n                    )\\n                    for (corner in corners) {\\n                        drawRect(\\n                            color = ResolveAmber,\\n                            topLeft = Offset(corner.x - 4.dp.toPx(), corner.y - 4.dp.toPx()),\\n                            size = Size(8.dp.toPx(), 8.dp.toPx())\\n                        )\\n                        drawRect(\\n                            color = Color.White,\\n                            topLeft = Offset(corner.x - 2.dp.toPx(), corner.y - 2.dp.toPx()),\\n                            size = Size(4.dp.toPx(), 4.dp.toPx())\\n                        )\\n                    }\\n\\n                    // 4 Edge Midpoint Handles\\n                    val edgeMidpoints = listOf(\\n                        Offset(cx, cy - ry),\\n                        Offset(cx, cy + ry),\\n                        Offset(cx - rx, cy),\\n                        Offset(cx + rx, cy)\\n                    )\\n                    for (edge in edgeMidpoints) {\\n                        drawCircle(color = ResolveCyan, radius = 4.dp.toPx(), center = edge)\\n                    }\\n\\n                    // Center Crosshair\\n                    drawCircle(color = ResolveAmber, radius = 4.dp.toPx(), center = Offset(cx, cy))\\n                    drawLine(color = ResolveAmber, start = Offset(cx - 10.dp.toPx(), cy), end = Offset(cx + 10.dp.toPx(), cy), strokeWidth = 1.5.dp.toPx())\\n                    drawLine(color = ResolveAmber, start = Offset(cx, cy - 10.dp.toPx()), end = Offset(cx, cy + 10.dp.toPx()), strokeWidth = 1.5.dp.toPx())\\n                }\\n\\n                MaskType.LINEAR -> {\\n                    val lineY = cy\\n                    val featherDist = ry * mask.feather\\n\\n                    // Center baseline\\n                    drawLine(color = ResolveAmber, start = Offset(0f, lineY), end = Offset(w, lineY), strokeWidth = 2.dp.toPx())\\n                    // Feather lines\\n                    drawLine(\\n                        color = ResolveCyan.copy(alpha = 0.6f),\\n                        start = Offset(0f, lineY - featherDist),\\n                        end = Offset(w, lineY - featherDist),\\n                        strokeWidth = 1.dp.toPx(),\\n                        pathEffect = PathEffect.dashPathEffect(floatArrayOf(6f, 6f))\\n                    )\\n                    drawLine(\\n                        color = ResolveCyan.copy(alpha = 0.6f),\\n                        start = Offset(0f, lineY + featherDist),\\n                        end = Offset(w, lineY + featherDist),\\n                        strokeWidth = 1.dp.toPx(),\\n                        pathEffect = PathEffect.dashPathEffect(floatArrayOf(6f, 6f))\\n                    )\\n                    // Center drag puck\\n                    drawCircle(color = ResolveAmber, radius = 5.dp.toPx(), center = Offset(cx, cy))\\n                }\\n\\n                MaskType.NONE -> {}\\n            }\\n        }\\n\\n        // ==========================================\\n        // 2. FLOATING HUD TOOLBAR OVER VIDEO\\n        // ==========================================\\n        if (showQuickToolbar) {\\n            Row(\\n                verticalAlignment = Alignment.CenterVertically,\\n                horizontalArrangement = Arrangement.Center,\\n                modifier = Modifier\\n                    .align(Alignment.TopCenter)\\n                    .padding(top = 8.dp)\\n                    .clip(RoundedCornerShape(20.dp))\\n                    .background(Color(0xDD121620))\\n                    .border(1.dp, Color(0xFF2B3547), RoundedCornerShape(20.dp))\\n                    .padding(horizontal = 8.dp, vertical = 4.dp)\\n            ) {\\n                // Shape Toggle: Elliptical\\n                IconButton(\\n                    onClick = { onMaskChange(mask.copy(type = MaskType.ELLIPTICAL)) },\\n                    modifier = Modifier.size(28.dp).testTag(\\\"quick_mask_elliptical\\\")\\n                ) {\\n                    Icon(\\n                        imageVector = Icons.Default.Circle,\\n                        contentDescription = \\\"Elliptical Window\\\",\\n                        tint = if (mask.type == MaskType.ELLIPTICAL) ResolveAmber else TextMuted,\\n                        modifier = Modifier.size(16.dp)\\n                    )\\n                }\\n\\n                // Shape Toggle: Rectangular\\n                IconButton(\\n                    onClick = { onMaskChange(mask.copy(type = MaskType.RECTANGULAR)) },\\n                    modifier = Modifier.size(28.dp).testTag(\\\"quick_mask_rectangular\\\")\\n                ) {\\n                    Icon(\\n                        imageVector = Icons.Default.CropSquare,\\n                        contentDescription = \\\"Rectangular Window\\\",\\n                        tint = if (mask.type == MaskType.RECTANGULAR) ResolveAmber else TextMuted,\\n                        modifier = Modifier.size(16.dp)\\n                    )\\n                }\\n\\n                // Shape Toggle: Linear\\n                IconButton(\\n                    onClick = { onMaskChange(mask.copy(type = MaskType.LINEAR)) },\\n                    modifier = Modifier.size(28.dp).testTag(\\\"quick_mask_linear\\\")\\n                ) {\\n                    Icon(\\n                        imageVector = Icons.Default.HorizontalRule,\\n                        contentDescription = \\\"Linear Window\\\",\\n                        tint = if (mask.type == MaskType.LINEAR) ResolveAmber else TextMuted,\\n                        modifier = Modifier.size(16.dp)\\n                    )\\n                }\\n\\n                VerticalDivider(color = Color(0xFF334155), modifier = Modifier.height(16.dp).padding(horizontal = 4.dp))\\n\\n                // Invert Toggle\\n                IconButton(\\n                    onClick = { onMaskChange(mask.copy(invert = !mask.invert)) },\\n                    modifier = Modifier.size(28.dp).testTag(\\\"quick_mask_invert\\\")\\n                ) {\\n                    Icon(\\n                        imageVector = Icons.Default.Flip,\\n                        contentDescription = \\\"Invert Mask\\\",\\n                        tint = if (mask.invert) ResolveAmber else TextMuted,\\n                        modifier = Modifier.size(16.dp)\\n                    )\\n                }\\n\\n                // Highlight / Matte View Toggle (DaVinci Resolve Shift+H mode)\\n                IconButton(\\n                    onClick = { onMaskChange(mask.copy(showMatte = !mask.showMatte)) },\\n                    modifier = Modifier.size(28.dp).testTag(\\\"quick_mask_matte_toggle\\\")\\n                ) {\\n                    Icon(\\n                        imageVector = if (mask.showMatte) Icons.Default.Contrast else Icons.Default.Tonality,\\n                        contentDescription = \\\"Show Alpha Matte\\\",\\n                        tint = if (mask.showMatte) ResolveCyan else TextMuted,\\n                        modifier = Modifier.size(16.dp)\\n                    )\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\",\"Description\":\"Create MaskingOverlay.kt with interactive handles for drawing, resizing, and feathering elliptical and rectangular power windows over video preview\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"TargetFile\":\"/app/src/main/java/com/example/ui/components/MaskingOverlay.kt\",\"toolAction\":\"Writing MaskingOverlay.kt\",\"toolSummary\":\"Create MaskingOverlay component\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\257\r\n\254\r\001i\024}\023\222Hv \355\036\203%?\020\016H\212\320\0319\361\362n\241\216i\222k\3425b\330\320\372wM\242\2422\340R\364\204\v0B\360\024\2354\277P2\272\270\277\255\222\016\261\312@h\27196\3417\347u\276\3546\224\261$\360\245\016t\027f\2516\034\317\274+\276\030\336\264\256@j\202q\352\000\037\301\b\325~\216\224a\353~0\r\260\021\304\343\364c\362w\220\207\032\326\201nb=X\204\303\213\201\365\375\351(;\\\030\257L\371\265K\227\371R\'\356z\262\270\031\022e3\020HX\312*G\367^\316\354Qa\366,\004^0\025\345\350.\252\260*Z\2045\357\246\361z\3128\213\340-V\233\374\001\326\315\340\334\373Q\351\r\270#Ia\0169\260s\026\263\211\255sZgd\372\371\213{\020\026\200\325\374\207\310\fK\032P=\275\t\322\257\306gu]\325l\356\362\244s\243\341T8\351c\177\357\037\r\330\323\362\217\371XF\315\214P\333\223n\232$oyL\314\271_(9\266\034n\231\210\022\326\264\252hp5Gn6\201<\233a\347\027\2549\f\265\260\342E\251\3741\201\326\376\272h\317\017P\224\256\326\357\273\000\300\211\366\202\261_\320\266\366\370\307\352\365O\245\267\320\006\2546\036kv\374\332=V!i\307`X\271>))\250\035@r\323\324Dd\240\355F\335\314^S\274Q~\2133#\275\"\245\227\006=\255\301,\n\343\332Oc\330vd\001\344\274\223\342\252\032!\310\204\202\r\302\322\315\260\003\024\004 \367\177\377a\255(V\364\354\227\2770A\321\034?\002\242\025CJv\311wc.\203\240>:\236ex5\307\264x<\226q\'\336\017k\253t\316\260\320Y\334\232y\204\255\237\332\331Z\030_\241z\351Q~\302\266{\376\3669\336,\263\222a\035\213\312\b\334\336\325\252\'F\003/^\342\353\350A\031\350\306\345\031\033\3044\325\240\277eS\222\322\025\bn\260\312\252V\354\337k\024\243\271\307\254,\035\264\317\234\036v\324\325\246\031\345P\357\232k\277\237\213\333\037\367\372_\032\rHl\310g/h5\035Y\302\305\301\311\353\000\265\303@\200\362\373!\306h\374k\377w\3706\345\232\301\337\360\235q\377\244\346:mdL9\212Du\\\300g\263B\314\330\277\212\223Y\210\317\306j\2734m\256\241fQ\035\250\030\003\235\242?\tck\204\"\240\207\314\b\340\340\213\273u y\205\216X\0334V\346\032\255M\327R+k\220\312\262\265gkc\021\017f\222u\216\243\037\342\210\0169\365\207\366\257\337\333\022\307GP\271c\324Y-\030@\242@\257m\032Oc\236\020q\"e\232\331-i\260\006\037\314KG\003\202\f\233\264`\a\35253S\311\201!E\361\027\275\342\a\273\371I6\035r\272\367\370,\000{4\367\346l\266\004$M\f\345U\222~\364\232\035\303\334)\203R\305\267\246\262S\266\250]<\023\311\200\342N\231\346B\247E=af{\221\205\307\356*\262\234h\274)Es\031b=\355\001u\214,\310\275\026\325\026JC\370n#\240fOfg\246(\002\315\357\333ty\241:\323\236\227\245\307,\236\216\330k\266/\274\0373\033\3463A\240\321\323K\374g/\255\376G\344$\220\356]\254s\226^\227\030r\237\355\247\016\027\347\263wz=v\373f\340[\023\215r\237\b\276x\215[/+J\326\224\254\257\333\032\257\365\273\371\236\363\273\266\302e\245\277\366\373O\242@\n{\223>\3244\254G\235\365b\217_\033r\217\315\244|@\270\002\303C_!\273)\310C\365\330\257!>S\001L\033/\237\')CI\356r\303g\340\216wo\n<\t\0270\000\353T\a\031\375\311\r\017\236\363\002 \034\377\224\233 \030\316\251\260HH\333\375\245\273\323\263\020\302Pc7\026<\344\3274b\242\206\234\216\351\367\263n\303\315H\214\271\345\021\a\027l\231\321\362|5u\226<a~\2543 aK\\\033\272\300\036w\257\374\223\230\312\235%(\353\037=)u\311\037\030\300s\037\262p\341\035\006\334p7\375u\254\021\000\035\246\203\334%l^\261\377\262y\311T.z\361/\351=\277a\362\253\2275a\003\261\n%\245\243\266\324\255\333\354\352}\372+\271\022\t\341\331\343\242\300\203\254\233\023\304\211\337\fs\003@\335\244<\n\242\215\377\227v\337\201\210=S}\231\341S\020\366H\f>\370\251?&ac.\017\337h\236\262\211\360\240\236p\v\n \202Q\374\022{\003Z\024\rM/\223}Z\351\254\237Ze\025\230\3315Q|\227\023\232\177\tvs\353|y\355\024\346\215=\216\375\361\'I\360\354\036u\312\021\254\334\334{\207\177\316\031os\341R+\025\210,.\322i\037@\350\032\350L \352:;\277\260\211A\274\213\031\265:\367l\226\321\314i\301i\303\370\234\250\325\005\032\221D\366\257\023\v\024Cpt\245-\260\231\210\233\030\300\"\271\257\336\207[!&?i\316\265<9\375\247\311\256\263g\a\3155\255\302\bP\363\324E\351x\332\263\274\036\242\250\322\037r\017\302\325\232{X\206\361\360\265\310@\226iL&\307Z\371m}}\372\340\235jix9XS\3071\320\303:v[\361x\203\b\004\027\3718\324)\376\221;_\222\032Zn@\033\365\343\3126{\361\270\370\221\206\202\237\207\223\303WFP\266\023\247a\276\220\324\232\332a\212HF\212e\202WO\217`\362\223\022\362\326\374^\350\304\026X\242\374\313\b\321\314\361t*\242\272\372\206zz\231\024O\247\r\025>`\004\001 \222\374\213\230\202\301\301\\?\r\372\261\237Q3\275\217\215}\267\t\363YF@(\325\260\b\351)@\246\314\374\r\031AG\342\233\027\220\251t\340\234\314T-\277\223\375\352\032\003S4\217\245\025n\"O<\365\006\\\262\226\306\307\224Yh\250\311\264\220\247\347\245\376\361^\364\324fa2N\235\242\320i\016\002VBkV\277BY\002@Z\326\215\027\302\266\274a\352\343G\037\177\235\207^\346\340\325-\0226\001d;\313\033\211\377\277\360\345\017i&lI.\027[Z\322L\316\327\353\276Hv\340Wa]\026\360z%\031\306\246GR\225 \243\0041\310\244P\226\253\217\350\332\240MG\305R\206\211("
