  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Integrating Undo Redo**\n\nI\'m currently integrating the `UndoRedoManager` into `GradingViewModel.kt`. I\'ve added the `UndoRedoManager` instance and the corresponding `MutableStateFlow` for `_canUndo` and `_canRedo` along with their exposed state flows. I\'m focusing on ensuring these flows accurately reflect the undo/redo capabilities within the view model. This is the first step in enabling the functionality.\n\n\n**Adding State Flows**\n\nI\'ve added several `MutableStateFlow` instances. Specifically, I\'ve incorporated `_canRedo`, `_historyEntries`, and `_historyActionToast` to manage redo status, history entries, and toast messages respectively. Corresponding read-only state flows are exposed. Also, I\'ve implemented a debounced snapshot commit job, and added `updateSettings` function to update the settings to the model.\n\n\n**Implementing Undo Redo Actions**\n\nI\'ve implemented `commitSnapshot`, `syncUndoRedoState`, `undo`, and `redo` functions. The `commitSnapshot` function pushes the current grade settings to the `UndoRedoManager` along with a description, followed by syncing the undo/redo state. The `undo` and `redo` functions now retrieve settings from the manager, trigger a grade update, and sync state. Finally, I\'ve added a function to jump to specific history entries.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_163979"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false,\"Description\":\"Add UndoRedoManager, canUndo, canRedo, historyEntries, and undo/redo functions to GradingViewModel\",\"EndLine\":115,\"Instruction\":\"Add undo/redo stack manager integration and state flows\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"    // Undo / Redo Stack State\\n    private val undoRedoManager = UndoRedoManager()\\n    private val _canUndo = MutableStateFlow(false)\\n    val canUndo = _canUndo.asStateFlow()\\n\\n    private val _canRedo = MutableStateFlow(false)\\n    val canRedo = _canRedo.asStateFlow()\\n\\n    private val _historyEntries = MutableStateFlow<List<HistoryEntry>>(emptyList())\\n    val historyEntries = _historyEntries.asStateFlow()\\n\\n    private val _historyActionToast = MutableStateFlow<String?>(null)\\n    val historyActionToast = _historyActionToast.asStateFlow()\\n\\n    private var historyDebounceJob: Job? = null\\n    private var pendingActionDescription: String = \\\"Color Grade Change\\\"\\n\\n    private var playbackJob: Job? = null\\n    private var gradeJob: Job? = null\\n    private var importedVideoUri: Uri? = null\\n\\n    init {\\n        loadScene(SampleScene.S24_LOG_SUNSET_PORTRAIT)\\n        syncUndoRedoState()\\n    }\\n\\n    fun updateSettings(\\n        description: String = \\\"Color Grade Change\\\",\\n        immediateCommit: Boolean = false,\\n        transform: (ColorGradeSettings) -> ColorGradeSettings\\n    ) {\\n        _gradeSettings.value = transform(_gradeSettings.value)\\n        triggerGrade()\\n\\n        if (immediateCommit) {\\n            historyDebounceJob?.cancel()\\n            commitSnapshot(description)\\n        } else {\\n            pendingActionDescription = description\\n            historyDebounceJob?.cancel()\\n            historyDebounceJob = viewModelScope.launch {\\n                delay(350L) // Quiet time debounce for continuous wheel / curve / mask gestures\\n                commitSnapshot(pendingActionDescription)\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    private fun commitSnapshot(description: String) {\\n        undoRedoManager.pushSnapshot(_gradeSettings.value, description)\\n        syncUndoRedoState()\\n    }\\n\\n    private fun syncUndoRedoState() {\\n        _canUndo.value = undoRedoManager.canUndo\\n        _canRedo.value = undoRedoManager.canRedo\\n        _historyEntries.value = undoRedoManager.historyEntries\\n    }\\n\\n    fun undo() {\\n        val entry = undoRedoManager.undo() ?: return\\n        _gradeSettings.value = entry.settings\\n        triggerGrade()\\n        syncUndoRedoState()\\n        _historyActionToast.value = \\\"Undo: ${entry.description}\\\"\\n    }\\n\\n    fun redo() {\\n        val entry = undoRedoManager.redo() ?: return\\n        _gradeSettings.value = entry.settings\\n        triggerGrade()\\n        syncUndoRedoState()\\n        _historyActionToast.value = \\\"Redo: ${entry.description}\\\"\\n    }\\n\\n    fun jumpToHistory(entry: HistoryEntry) {\\n        val settings = undoRedoManager.jumpTo(entry) ?: return\\n        _gradeSettings.value = settings\\n        triggerGrade()\\n        syncUndoRedoState()\\n        _historyActionToast.value = \\\"Jumped to: ${entry.description}\\\"\\n    }\\n\\n    fun resetGrade() {\\n        val defaultSettings = ColorGradeSettings()\\n        _gradeSettings.value = defaultSettings\\n        undoRedoManager.reset(defaultSettings)\\n        triggerGrade()\\n        syncUndoRedoState()\\n        _historyActionToast.value = \\\"Reset all grades\\\"\\n    }\\n\\n    fun clearActionToast() {\\n        _historyActionToast.value = null\\n    }\\n\\n    fun setBypass(bypass: Boolean) {\\n        _gradeSettings.value = _gradeSettings.value.copy(bypass = bypass)\\n        triggerGrade()\\n    }\",\"StartLine\":51,\"TargetContent\":\"    private var playbackJob: Job? = null\\n    private var gradeJob: Job? = null\\n    private var importedVideoUri: Uri? = null\\n\\n    init {\\n        loadScene(SampleScene.S24_LOG_SUNSET_PORTRAIT)\\n    }\\n\\n    fun loadScene(scene: SampleScene) {\\n        _currentScene.value = scene\\n        importedVideoUri = null\\n        val raw = SampleMediaGenerator.generateLogFrame(scene, frameIndex = 0)\\n        _rawFrameBitmap.value = raw\\n        triggerGrade()\\n    }\\n\\n    fun onImportVideoUri(uri: Uri) {\\n        viewModelScope.launch(Dispatchers.IO) {\\n            try {\\n                importedVideoUri = uri\\n                val retriever = MediaMetadataRetriever()\\n                retriever.setDataSource(getApplication(), uri)\\n                val durationStr = retriever.extractMetadata(MediaMetadataRetriever.METADATA_KEY_DURATION)\\n                val durMs = durationStr?.toLongOrNull() ?: 5000L\\n                _totalDurationMs.value = durMs\\n\\n                val frame = retriever.getFrameAtTime(0, MediaMetadataRetriever.OPTION_CLOSEST_SYNC)\\n                if (frame != null) {\\n                    _rawFrameBitmap.value = frame\\n                    triggerGrade()\\n                }\\n                retriever.release()\\n            } catch (e: Exception) {\\n                e.printStackTrace()\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fun onImportCubeLut(cubeContent: String) {\\n        val parsed = SamsungLogColorScience.parseCubeLut(cubeContent)\\n        if (parsed != null) {\\n            val (size, data) = parsed\\n            updateSettings {\\n                it.copy(\\n                    activeLut = LutPreset.CUSTOM_CUBE,\\n                    customLutSize = size,\\n                    customLutData = data\\n                )\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fun updateSettings(transform: (ColorGradeSettings) -> ColorGradeSettings) {\\n        _gradeSettings.value = transform(_gradeSettings.value)\\n        triggerGrade()\\n    }\\n\\n    fun setBypass(bypass: Boolean) {\\n        _gradeSettings.value = _gradeSettings.value.copy(bypass = bypass)\\n        triggerGrade()\\n    }\",\"TargetFile\":\"/app/sr