      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false,\"Description\":\"Add unit tests for UndoRedoManager in ExampleUnitTest.kt\",\"EndLine\":105,\"Instruction\":\"Add testUndoRedoManager test method\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"        val parsed = SamsungLogColorScience.parseCubeLut(sampleCube)\\n        assertNotNull(parsed)\\n        assertEquals(2, parsed!!.first)\\n        assertEquals(2 * 2 * 2 * 3, parsed.second.size)\\n    }\\n\\n    @Test\\n    fun testUndoRedoManager() {\\n        val manager = UndoRedoManager(maxHistory = 10)\\n        assertFalse(manager.canUndo)\\n        assertFalse(manager.canRedo)\\n        assertEquals(1, manager.historyEntries.size)\\n\\n        // 1. Change lift\\n        val state1 = ColorGradeSettings(lift = WheelValue(x = 0.2f, y = 0.1f, lum = 0.05f))\\n        manager.pushSnapshot(state1, \\\"Adjust Lift\\\")\\n        assertTrue(manager.canUndo)\\n        assertFalse(manager.canRedo)\\n        assertEquals(2, manager.historyEntries.size)\\n\\n        // 2. Change curves\\n        val state2 = state1.copy(contrast = 1.35f)\\n        manager.pushSnapshot(state2, \\\"Adjust Contrast\\\")\\n        assertEquals(3, manager.historyEntries.size)\\n\\n        // 3. Undo\\n        val undid = manager.undo()\\n        assertNotNull(undid)\\n        assertEquals(\\\"Adjust Lift\\\", undid!!.description)\\n        assertEquals(state1, undid.settings)\\n        assertTrue(manager.canUndo)\\n        assertTrue(manager.canRedo)\\n\\n        // 4. Redo\\n        val redid = manager.redo()\\n        assertNotNull(redid)\\n        assertEquals(\\\"Adjust Contrast\\\", redid!!.description)\\n        assertEquals(state2, redid.settings)\\n        assertFalse(manager.canRedo)\\n\\n        // 5. Jump back to initial\\n        val initialEntry = manager.historyEntries.first()\\n        val jumped = manager.jumpTo(initialEntry)\\n        assertNotNull(jumped)\\n        assertFalse(manager.canUndo)\\n        assertTrue(manager.canRedo)\\n    }\\n}\",\"StartLine\":100,\"TargetContent\":\"        val parsed = SamsungLogColorScience.parseCubeLut(sampleCube)\\n        assertNotNull(parsed)\\n        assertEquals(2, parsed!!.first)\\n        assertEquals(2 * 2 * 2 * 3, parsed.second.size)\\n    }\\n}\",\"TargetFile\":\"/app/src/test/java/com/example/ExampleUnitTest.kt\",\"toolAction\":\"Adding undo/redo unit tests\",\"toolSummary\":\"Add unit test for UndoRedoManager\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\265\001\n\262\001\001i\024}\023\233L\265E\221_\b\247\324\267\031J\"an\r\b#\035\224\343\024\252\257R\253MM\005\316\300\251\363O\350\240Rqo?\304\030]\301 \313i\234\313\364\330y\235\2518-j\307\270K\227\a&\345\2334\3018\305\210;#\372\226\204\256\364{\004\216\202\027\301\331\255\350\357S\370\314XC\374\374\001\304\3127S\000p\305\236v\v\274\027\221J\327\000\025\357\177\276e\30208\023-\355\006\200Ah\017z\263\205\005\344+\v\252\211\024,\250\324\343xa\032\312\3422\230\303+U\362\001\350J\263\030k\237W\336\367\3200\rGItq\311\252\251L"
