  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining the Component\'s Scope**\n\nI\'m focusing on the core requirement: a LUT Manager. My attention is drawn to the need for a built-in LUT library, especially the S24 Ultra Log to Rec.709 profile. The preview toggle will enhance user experience, and I\'m determining the best way to integrate that feature within the component.\n\n\n**Expanding the LUT Library**\n\nI\'ve determined that a dedicated `LutManager.kt` component is the ideal approach, incorporating a built-in library. It will include a range of color transformation LUTs optimized for Samsung S24 Ultra Log footage. My priority is providing a diverse selection, including Rec.709 standards, cinematic styles like Teal & Orange, and film stock emulations. A preview toggle is also a key feature.\n\n\n**Expanding Feature Set**\n\nI\'m now integrating crucial features. External `.cube` file import/export is a priority for LUT flexibility, while custom LUT creation from current grades in `SamsungLogColorScience.kt` is underway. Real-time histograms with clipping warnings are being designed, ensuring they update dynamically. Finally, I\'m verifying mobile responsiveness across various screen sizes.\n\n\n"
