    captured_user_requests {
      text: "That lets me color grade with lut and color wheels ans curves and hal and evetry other feature that davinci resolve have like masking n .....\nBut for android mobile and specially tuend for color grading samsung s24 ultra log 4k video\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nInstructions: If you need more context from the user you must first ask the user some questions using the ask_question tool. If you ask questions, you must wait for the user\'s answers. After the questions you must present a plan.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    }
    captured_user_requests {
      text: "<clarifying-answers>\nQ: What is your primary workflow for graded videos?\nA: Full MP4 video export with LUT and frame export\nQ: How would you like the color grading interface organized?\nA: Studio dock with scopes, color wheels, and curves\nQ: Which Samsung S24 Ultra profile will you grade most often?\nA: You need to search and see what is the samsung log profile i use pro video in camera app and shoot 4k lot\n</clarifying-answers>"
    }
    captured_user_requests {
      text: "Proceed\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nPlan action: proceed\nPlan path: .aistudio/artifacts/brain/b8cc472f-e5b7-4f58-917d-8bf4ecb9256e/implementation_plan.md\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    }
    captured_user_requests {
      text: "Create a layout container for the UI studio dock that hosts the color wheels, curve editors, and real-time histogram/vectorscope components."
    }
    captured_user_requests {
      text: "Create a reusable \'ColorWheel\' component in Jetpack Compose that provides visual feedback for hue and saturation adjustments, specifically designed to modify lift, gamma, and gain values for high-bitrate video footage."
    }
    captured_user_requests {
      text: "Build a \'MaskingOverlay\' feature that allows users to draw elliptical or rectangular power windows over the video preview for localized color adjustments."
    }
    captured_user_requests {
      text: "Add an undo/redo stack manager to keep track of changes made in the color wheels, curves, and masking overlays for a professional grading workflow."
    }
    captured_user_requests {
      text: "Create a \'LUT Manager\' component that includes a built-in library of color transformation LUTs specifically optimized for mapping Samsung S24 Ultra Log footage to Rec.709, with a preview toggle.\nAdd and creat diffrent lut \nAnd add histogram real time and make sure the whole app is mobile rrsponsive"
    }
  }
