  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Clear Structure**\n\nI\'m structuring the changes meticulously. First, I\'m extending the LUT architecture and preset model within `ColorGradeState.kt`. I\'m adding more Samsung Log -> Rec.709 optimized profiles to `LutPreset`, specifically including `SAMSUNG_LOG_TO_REC709`. This ensures a clean and effective implementation of the desired changes.\n\n\n**Expanding Preset Options**\n\nI\'m now expanding the preset options. I\'ve integrated profiles like \"S24 Log -> Rec.709 Natural\" and \"SAMSUNG_REC709_PUNCH\" that offer vivid, high-dynamic punch. I\'m also adding \"SAMSUNG_CINE_WARM\" for cinematic warmth. Film emulation profiles are in the mix, including \"Kodak 2383 Print\" and \"Fuji Eterna 250D.\" Additionally, I am including \"Teal & Orange\", and \"Clean Commercial\" profiles. I am also working on black and white profiles, and vibrant neon profiles.\n\n\n**Adding Custom LUTs**\n\nI\'m now integrating custom LUT management. I\'ve defined `Vintage Warm Sepia`, `CUSTOM_SAVED` for user-created looks, and `CUSTOM_CUBE` for imported .cube files. I\'ve also created a `CustomLut` data class and updated `ColorGradeSettings` to include `lutBypass`, `customLuts`, and `selectedCustomLutId`. The mathematical transforms for new presets are also in progress.\n\n\n**Refining Profile Details**\n\nI\'m refining several key profiles now. I\'ve detailed \"S24 Log\" dynamic range expansion, gentle S-curve, and chroma adjustments. I\'m focusing on softer contrast, cyan/green midtone cast, and muted highlights for \"Film Fuji Eterna.\" I\'m implementing a high dynamic range black and white conversion for \"Monochrome Noir\" using BT.709 luma coefficients. Also, I\'ve defined an electric night look for \"Cyber Neon Night.\" In addition, I have a warm amber-gold tone for \"Vintage Sepia\". I am also working on `lutBypass` for direct A/B comparison. Finally, I\'m setting up a `LutManager.kt` to organize a built-in library, including the \"Samsung Log -> Rec.709\" category.\n\n\n**Implementing User Interface**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the user interface enhancements. I\'m adding a prominent \"LUT Preview\" toggle for instant A/B comparisons. Visual badges will indicate LUT activity, along with live preview thumbnails for each preset and an intensity slider. Furthermore, I\'m integrating a \"Save Current Grade as LUT\" workflow, complete with a modal dialog for custom LUT creation.\n\n\n**Adding Cube Import/Export**\n\nI\'m now implementing the ability to import and export .cube LUTs. I\'ve added \"Import .cube\" functionality using a system file picker. I\'m also enabling .cube export for both custom and built-in LUTs. I am also working on adding user LUT deletion features.\n\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_3568570834431548395"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false,\"Description\":\"Expand LutPreset enum and add CustomLut and lutBypass to ColorGradeSettings\",\"EndLine\":102,\"Instruction\":\"Add expanded Samsung S24 Log -> Rec.709 and film LUT presets, CustomLut data class, and lutBypass flag in ColorGradeSettings\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"enum class LutCategory(val displayName: String) {\\n    SAMSUNG_LOG(\\\"Samsung S24 Log \342\206\222 Rec.709\\\"),\\n    FILM_PRINT(\\\"Cinema & Film Stocks\\\"),\\n    CREATIVE(\\\"Creative Looks\\\"),\\n    CUSTOM(\\\"My Custom LUTs\\\")\\n}\\n\\ndata class CustomLut(\\n    val id: String = java.util.UUID.randomUUID().toString(),\\n    val name: String,\\n    val description: String = \\\"User created grade\\\",\\n    val dateCreated: Long = System.currentTimeMillis(),\\n    val lift: WheelValue = WheelValue(),\\n    val gamma: WheelValue = WheelValue(),\\n    val gain: WheelValue = WheelValue(),\\n    val offset: WheelValue = WheelValue(),\\n    val contrast: Float = 1.0f,\\n    val saturation: Float = 1.0f,\\n    val temperature: Float = 0.0f,\\n    val tint: Float = 0.0f,\\n    val exposure: Float = 0.0f\\n) : Serializable\\n\\nenum class LutPreset(\\n    val displayName: String,\\n    val description: String,\\n    val category: LutCategory\\n) {\\n    SAMSUNG_LOG_TO_REC709(\\n        \\\"Samsung Log \342\206\222 Rec.709 Natural\\\",\\n        \\\"Official S24 Ultra 10-bit logarithmic recovery with neutral white point\\\",\\n        LutCategory.SAMSUNG_LOG\\n    ),\\n    SAMSUNG_REC709_PUNCH(\\n        \\\"Samsung S24 Vivid Punch\\\",\\n        \\\"High dynamic punch with vibrant saturation and clean black floor\\\",\\n        LutCategory.SAMSUNG_LOG\\n    ),\\n    SAMSUNG_CINE_WARM(\\n        \\\"Samsung Cine Warm\\\",\\n        \\\"Rich cinematic skin tones with amber highlights and gentle contrast\\\",\\n        LutCategory.SAMSUNG_LOG\\n    ),\\n    FILM_EMULATION_KODAK(\\n        \\\"Kodak 2383 Print Stock\\\",\\n        \\\"Legendary cinema print stock with gentle highlight roll-off and deep teal shadows\\\",\\n        LutCategory.FILM_PRINT\\n    ),\\n    FILM_FUJI_ETERNA(\\n        \\\"Fuji Eterna 250D\\\",\\n        \\\"Subtle desaturated pastels, soft contrast, and rich foliage greens\\\",\\n        LutCategory.FILM_PRINT\\n    ),\\n    BLOCKBUSTER_TEAL_ORANGE(\\n        \\\"Blockbuster Teal & Orange\\\",\\n        \\\"Hollywood punch with complementary color separation\\\",\\n        LutCategory.FILM_PRINT\\n    ),\\n    CLEAN_COMMERCIAL(\\n        \\\"Clean Commercial High-Key\\\",\\n        \\\"Crisp whites, neutral skin tones, high dynamic clarity\\\",\\n        LutCategory.FILM_PRINT\\n    ),\\n    MONOCHROME_NOIR(\\n        \\\"Silver Gelatin B&W\\\",\\n        \\\"Rich black and white tonal curve with deep contrast and metallic highlights\\\",\\n        LutCategory.CREATIVE\\n    ),\\n    CYBER_NEON_NIGHT(\\n        \\\"Cyberpunk Neon\\\",\\n        \\\"Electric cyan and magenta separation tuned for night cityscapes\\\",\\n        LutCategory.CREATIVE\\n    ),\\n    VINTAGE_SEPIA(\\n        \\\"Vintage Warm Sepia\\\",\\n        \\\"Nostalgic golden-hour warm shadows with analog softness\\\",\\n        LutCategory.CREATIVE\\n    ),\\n    CUSTOM_SAVED(\\n        \\\"Custom Grade LUT\\\",\\n        \\\"User created custom color transformation\\\",\\n        LutCategory.CUSTOM\\n    ),\\n    CUSTOM_CUBE(\\n        \\\"Custom .cube 3D LUT\\\",\\n        \\\"Imported 3D LUT table\\\",\\n        LutCategory.CUSTOM\\n    )\\n}\\n\\ndata class ColorGradeSettings(\\n    // Primary Wheels\\n    val lift: WheelValue = WheelValue(),\\n    val gamma: WheelValue = WheelValue(),\\n    val gain: WheelValue = WheelValue(),\\n    val offset: WheelValue = WheelValue(),\\n\\n    // Basic Sliders\\n    val contrast: Float = 1.0f,           // 0.5..1.8\\n    val saturation: Float = 1.0f,         // 0.0..2.0\\n    val temperature: Float = 0.0f,       // -1.0..1.0 (Cool to Warm)\\n    val tint: Float = 0.0f,              // -1.0..1.0 (Green to Magenta)\\n    val exposure: Float = 0.0f,          // -2.0..2.0 EV\\n    val highlights: Float = 0.0f,        // -1.0..1.0\\n    val shadows: Float = 0.0f,           // -1.0..1.0\\n\\n    // Samsung S24 Ultra Log Specific\\n    val samsungLogTransform: Boolean = true,\\n    val samsungHighlightRollOff: Float = 0.75f,\\n    val samsungDynamicToneMapping: Boolean = true,\\n\\n    // LUT\\n    val activeLut: LutPreset = LutPreset.SAMSUNG_LOG_TO_REC709,\\n    val lutIntensity: Float = 1.0f,\\n    val lutBypass: Boolean = false,       // Instant A/B preview toggle\\n    val customLutData: FloatArray? = null,\\n    val customLutSize: Int = 0,\\n    val customLuts: List<CustomLut> = emptyList(),\\n    val selectedCustomLutId: String? = null,\\n\\n    // Curves\\n    val curves: RgbCurves = RgbCurves(),\\n\\n    // Masking / Power Window\\n    val mask: PowerWindowMask = PowerWindowMask(),\\n\\n    // Effects\\n    val effects: FilmEffects = FilmEffects(),\\n\\n    // State Toggles\\n    val bypass: Boolean = false\\n) : Serializable\",\"StartLine\":54,\"TargetContent\":\"enum class LutPreset(val displayName: String, val description: String) {\\n    SAMSUNG_LOG_TO_REC709(\\\"Samsung Log \342\206\222 Rec.709\\\", \\\"Official S24 Ultra 10-bit logarithmic recovery\\\"),\\n    SAMSUNG_CINE_WARM(\\\"Samsung Cine Warm\\\", \\\"Rich cinematic skin tones with amber highlights\\\"),\\n    BLOCKBUSTER_TEAL_ORANGE(\\\"Blockbuster Teal & Orange\\\", \\\"Hollywood punch with complementary color separation\\\"),\\n    CLEAN_COMMERCIAL(\\\"Clean Commercial\\\", \\\"Crisp whites, neutral skin tones, high dynamic contrast\\\"),\\n    FILM_EMULATION_KODAK(\\\"Kodak 2383 Print\\\", \\\"Legendary cinema film print stock with gentle roll-off\\\"),\\n    CUSTOM_CUBE(\\\"Custom .cube LUT\\\", \\\"Imported 3D LUT table\\\")\\n}\\n\\ndata class ColorGradeSettings(\\n    // Primary Wheels\\n    val lift: WheelValue = WheelValue(),\\n    val gamma: WheelValue