  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Verifying Clean State**\n\nI\'ve just successfully built and tested the debug unit tests for the application, and everything passed! Now, I am quickly checking the git status to confirm that everything is clean and in order, and also to see what files were touched. The first file on the list is Color.\n\n\n**Expanding LUT Presets**\n\nI\'ve significantly expanded the `LutPreset` in `GradeState.kt`, incorporating many new color profiles and options like custom LUT support. I also added `CustomLut` and `lutBypass` within `ColorGradeSettings`. I\'ve implemented math transforms for all LUT presets in `SamsungLogColorScience.kt` and now have instant A/B bypass checks. I\'ve also added real-time histogram calculation. I enhanced the `HistogramCanvas` in `ScopesView.kt` with live IRE graticules and luminance statistics. Finally, I\342\200\231ve built a dedicated 3D LUT Manager with numerous features, in `LutManager.kt`.\n\n\n"
