    response: "### 3D LUT Manager, Real-Time Histogram & Mobile Responsive Studio\n\n#### 1. 3D LUT Manager Component (`LutManager.kt`)\n- **Built-in S24 Log $\\rightarrow$ Rec.709 & Cinema Library**:\n  - **Samsung S24 Log $\\rightarrow$ Rec.709 Natural**: Colorimetric logarithmic recovery mapping flat 10-bit log gamma to Rec.709.\n  - **Samsung S24 Vivid Punch**: Expanded dynamic range, +20% contrast, and vibrant saturation.\n  - **Samsung Cine Warm**: Golden-hour skin tones with amber highlights.\n  - **Kodak 2383 Print Stock**: Legendary print emulation with rich teal shadows and soft highlight roll-off.\n  - **Fuji Eterna 250D**: Low-contrast pastel tones, muted highlights, and rich foliage greens.\n  - **Blockbuster Teal & Orange**: Complementary Hollywood color separation.\n  - **Clean Commercial High-Key**: Pure whites, neutral skin tones, and high dynamic clarity.\n  - **Silver Gelatin B&W**: High dynamic range black & white with deep contrast and metallic highlights.\n  - **Cyberpunk Neon & Vintage Sepia**: Stylized night and warm analog film aesthetics.\n- **Instant A/B Preview Toggle**:\n  - One-tap `[LUT ACTIVE (A) / BYPASS (B)]` toggle allowing immediate comparison of the footage with and without the LUT applied, without resetting other grading adjustments.\n- **Custom LUT Creation & Management**:\n  - **Save Current Grade as LUT** modal (`SaveLutDialog.kt`): Bakes the active color wheels, curves, exposure, and color balance into a named, reusable custom 3D profile stored in the user\'s library.\n  - One-tap custom LUT selection and deletion.\n  - External `.cube` file import and export compatibility.\n- **Intensity & Opacity Slider**:\n  - 0% to 100% fine-tuning with a one-tap 100% reset action.\n\n---\n\n#### 2. Real-Time Broadcast Histogram\n- **Live RGB & Luminance Waveform Curves**: Displays Red, Green, and Blue channels alongside a smooth Luminance fill.\n- **IRE Graticule Lines**: 0%, 25%, 50%, 75%, and 100% IRE legal broadcast limit indicators.\n- **Live Clipping Warnings**:\n  - Crushed blacks warning badge (pixels $< 1\\%$ IRE).\n  - Blown highlights warning badge (pixels $> 99\\%$ IRE).\n  - Real-time average luminance readout.\n\n---\n\n#### 3. Mobile Responsiveness\n- **Portrait Mobile Mode**: Vertically stacked 16:9 responsive viewport, horizontal scrolling color wheels and LUT decks, and touch targets meeting the 48dp standard.\n- **Landscape Studio Mode**: Auto-detects device orientation via `BoxWithConstraints`, splitting the UI into a side-by-side layout: live video viewport on the left, and the color wheels, curves, and 3D LUT dock on the right."
    modified_response: "### 3D LUT Manager, Real-Time Histogram & Mobile Responsive Studio\n\n#### 1. 3D LUT Manager Component (`LutManager.kt`)\n- **Built-in S24 Log $\\rightarrow$ Rec.709 & Cinema Library**:\n  - **Samsung S24 Log $\\rightarrow$ Rec.709 Natural**: Colorimetric logarithmic recovery mapping flat 10-bit log gamma to Rec.709.\n  - **Samsung S24 Vivid Punch**: Expanded dynamic range, +20% contrast, and vibrant saturation.\n  - **Samsung Cine Warm**: Golden-hour skin tones with amber highlights.\n  - **Kodak 2383 Print Stock**: Legendary print emulation with rich teal shadows and soft highlight roll-off.\n  - **Fuji Eterna 250D**: Low-contrast pastel tones, muted highlights, and rich foliage greens.\n  - **Blockbuster Teal & Orange**: Complementary Hollywood color separation.\n  - **Clean Commercial High-Key**: Pure whites, neutral skin tones, and high dynamic clarity.\n  - **Silver Gelatin B&W**: High dynamic range black & white with deep contrast and metallic highlights.\n  - **Cyberpunk Neon & Vintage Sepia**: Stylized night and warm analog film aesthetics.\n- **Instant A/B Preview Toggle**:\n  - One-tap `[LUT ACTIVE (A) / BYPASS (B)]` toggle allowing immediate comparison of the footage with and without the LUT applied, without resetting other grading adjustments.\n- **Custom LUT Creation & Management**:\n  - **Save Current Grade as LUT** modal (`SaveLutDialog.kt`): Bakes the active color wheels, curves, exposure, and color balance into a named, reusable custom 3D profile stored in the user\'s library.\n  - One-tap custom LUT selection and deletion.\n  - External `.cube` file import and export compatibility.\n- **Intensity & Opacity Slider**:\n  - 0% to 100% fine-tuning with a one-tap 100% reset action.\n\n---\n\n#### 2. Real-Time Broadcast Histogram\n- **Live RGB & Luminance Waveform Curves**: Displays Red, Green, and Blue channels alongside a smooth Luminance fill.\n- **IRE Graticule Lines**: 0%, 25%, 50%, 75%, and 100% IRE legal broadcast limit indicators.\n- **Live Clipping Warnings**:\n  - Crushed blacks warning badge (pixels $< 1\\%$ IRE).\n  - Blown highlights warning badge (pixels $> 99\\%$ IRE).\n  - Real-time average luminance readout.\n\n---\n\n#### 3. Mobile Responsiveness\n- **Portrait Mobile Mode**: Vertically stacked 16:9 responsive viewport, horizontal scrolling color wheels and LUT decks, and touch targets meeting the 48dp standard.\n- **Landscape Studio Mode**: Auto-detects device orientation via `BoxWithConstraints`, splitting the UI into a side-by-side layout: live video viewport on the left, and the color wheels, curves, and 3D LUT dock on the right."
