  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining the Menu Structure**\n\nOkay, I\'m now focusing on creating the `StudioFloatingActionMenu` component. Right now, I\'m outlining its core features, starting with a speed dial or expandable floating menu design. I\'m thinking it should float at the bottom end or the very bottom of the screen.\n\n\n**Revising the Display**\n\nI\'ve shifted the menu\'s location to the screen\'s center. The collapsed state now features a primary pill/FAB styled with Resolve Amber, which will display the active tool\'s icon and a corresponding badge, allowing quick access and expansion. The expanded speed dial view will contain floating action items for quick access to other tools. Smooth animations and backdrop scrims are a priority for the transition.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_1976738209128416350"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"package com.example.ui.components\\n\\nimport androidx.compose.animation.*\\nimport androidx.compose.animation.core.spring\\nimport androidx.compose.foundation.background\\nimport androidx.compose.foundation.border\\nimport androidx.compose.foundation.clickable\\nimport androidx.compose.foundation.layout.*\\nimport androidx.compose.foundation.shape.CircleShape\\nimport androidx.compose.foundation.shape.RoundedCornerShape\\nimport androidx.compose.material.icons.Icons\\nimport androidx.compose.material.icons.filled.*\\nimport androidx.compose.material3.*\\nimport androidx.compose.runtime.Composable\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.Alignment\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.Modifier\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.draw.clip\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.draw.shadow\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.graphics.Color\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.graphics.vector.ImageVector\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.platform.testTag\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.text.font.FontFamily\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.text.font.FontWeight\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.unit.dp\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.unit.sp\\nimport com.example.ui.theme.*\\n\\n/**\\n * A DaVinci Resolve-inspired Floating Action Menu (Speed Dial)\\n * used when the studio dock is collapsed on smaller screens to keep the video preview full-width.\\n */\\n@Composable\\nfun StudioFloatingActionMenu(\\n    activeTab: StudioToolTab,\\n    isExpanded: Boolean,\\n    onToggleExpanded: () -> Unit,\\n    onSelectTab: (StudioToolTab) -> Unit,\\n    onOpenToolSheet: () -> Unit,\\n    onExpandDock: () -> Unit,\\n    onBypassToggle: () -> Unit,\\n    isBypassActive: Boolean,\\n    modifier: Modifier = Modifier\\n) {\\n    Box(\\n        modifier = modifier\\n            .testTag(\\\"studio_floating_action_menu\\\")\\n            .padding(end = 12.dp, bottom = 12.dp),\\n        contentAlignment = Alignment.BottomEnd\\n    ) {\\n        Column(\\n            horizontalAlignment = Alignment.End,\\n            verticalArrangement = Arrangement.spacedBy(8.dp)\\n        ) {\\n            // ==========================================\\n            // SPEED DIAL POP-OUT ACTION BUTTONS\\n            // ==========================================\\n            AnimatedVisibility(\\n                visible = isExpanded,\\n                enter = fadeIn() + expandVertically(expandFrom = Alignment.Bottom, animationSpec = spring()),\\n                exit = fadeOut() + shrinkVertically(shrinkTowards = Alignment.Bottom, animationSpec = spring())\\n            ) {\\n                Column(\\n                    horizontalAlignment = Alignment.End,\\n                    verticalArrangement = Arrangement.spacedBy(8.dp),\\n                    modifier = Modifier.padding(bottom = 8.dp)\\n                ) {\\n                    // 1. Expand to Full Static Dock Action\\n                    FloatingMenuItem(\\n                        label = \\\"Expand Dock\\\",\\n                        icon = Icons.Default.OpenInFull,\\n                        accentColor = ResolveCyan,\\n                        onClick = onExpandDock,\\n                        testTag = \\\"speed_dial_expand_dock\\\"\\n                    )\\n\\n                    // 2. A/B Bypass Quick Toggle Action\\n                    FloatingMenuItem(\\n                        label = if (isBypassActive) \\\"Enable Grade\\\" else \\\"Bypass Grade\\\",\\n                        icon = if (isBypassActive) Icons.Default.Visibility else Icons.Default.VisibilityOff,\\n                        accentColor = if (isBypassActive) Color(0xFFEF4444) else ResolveGreen,\\n                        onClick = onBypassToggle,\\n                        testTag = \\\"speed_dial_bypass_toggle\\\"\\n                    )\\n\\n                    HorizontalDivider(\\n                        color = Color(0xFF263248),\\n                        modifier = Modifier.width(130.dp).padding(vertical = 2.dp)\\n                    )\\n\\n                    // 3. Tool Tabs (Wheels, Curves, LUTs, Mask, Effects)\\n                    StudioToolTab.values().forEach { tab ->\\n                        val isSelected = activeTab == tab\\n                        FloatingMenuItem(\\n                            label = tab.title,\\n                            icon = tab.icon,\\n                            accentColor = if (isSelected) ResolveAmber else TextSecondary,\\n                            isSelected = isSelected,\\n                            onClick = {\\n                                onSelectTab(tab)\\n                                onOpenToolSheet()\\n                            },\\n                            testTag = \\\"speed_dial_tab_${tab.name.lowercase()}\\\"\\n                        )\\n                    }\\n                }\\n            }\\n\\n            // ==========================================\\n            // MAIN FLOATING HUD PILL / FAB\\n            // ==========================================\\n            Surface(\\n                color = Color(0xFF141822),\\n                shape = RoundedCornerShape(24.dp),\\n                border = CardDefaults.outlinedCardBorder().copy(\\n                    brush = androidx.compose.ui.graphics.SolidColor(ResolveAmber.copy(alpha = 0.65f))\\n                ),\\n                shadowElevation = 8.dp,\\n                modifier = Modifier\\n                    .height(48.dp)\\n                    .shadow(10.dp, RoundedCornerShape(24.dp))\\n                    .testTag(\\\"floating_dock_pill\\\")\\n            ) {\\n                Row(\\n                    verticalAlignment = Alignment.CenterVertically,\\n                    modifier = Modifier.padding(horizontal = 6.dp, vertical = 4.dp)\\n                ) {\\n                    // Tap to Open Tool Grading Sheet\\n                    Row(\\n                        verticalAlignment = Alignment.CenterVertically,\\n                        modifier = Modifier\\n                            .clip(RoundedCornerShape(20.dp))\\n                            .clickable { onOpenToolSheet() }\\n                            .padding(horizontal = 10.dp, vertical = 6.dp)\\n                            .testTag(\\\"open_floating_tool_sheet_button\\\")\\n                    ) {\\n                        Box(\\n                            modifier = Modifier\\n                                .size(28.dp)\\n                                .clip(CircleShape)\\n                                .background(ResolveAmber.copy(alpha = 0.22f)),\\n                            contentAlignment = Alignment.Center\\n                        ) {\\n                            Icon(\\n                                imageVector = activeTab.icon,\\n                                contentDescription = activeTab.title,\\n                                tint = ResolveAmber,\\n                                modifier = Modifier.size(16.dp)\\n                            )\\n                        }\\n\\n                        Spacer(modifier = Modifier.width(8.dp))\\n\\n                        Column {\\n                            Text(\\n                                text = \\\"STUDIO TOOL\\\",\\n                                color = TextMuted,\\n                                fontSize = 8.sp,\\n                                fontWeight = FontWeight.Bold,\\n                                letterSpacing = 0.5.sp\\n                            )\\n                            Text(\\n                                text = activeTab.title.uppercase(),\\n                                color = TextPrimary,\\n                                fontSize = 11.sp,\\n                                fontWeight = FontWeight.Black,\\n                                fontFamily = FontFamily.Monospace\\n                            )\\n                        }\\n\\n                        Spacer(modifier = Modifier.width(4.dp))\\n\\n                        Icon(\\n                            imageVector = Icons.Default.Tune,\\n                            contentDescription = \\\"Adjust\\\",\\n                            tint = ResolveAmber,\\n                            modifier = Modifier.size(14.dp)\\n                        )\\n                    }\\n\\n                    VerticalDivider(\\n                        color = Color(0xFF283244),\\n                        modifier = Modifier\\n                            .height(24.dp)\\n                            .padding(horizontal = 4.dp)\\n                    )\\n\\n                    // Expand / Collapse Speed Dial Menu Button\\n                    IconButton(\\n                        onClick = onToggleExpanded,\\n                        modifier = Modifier\\n                            .size(36.dp)\\n                            .clip(CircleShape)\\n                            .background(if (isExpanded) ResolveAmber else Color(0xFF202736))\\n                            .testTag(\\\"toggle_speed_dial_button\\\")\\n                    ) {\\n                        Icon(\\n                            imageVector = if (isExpanded) Icons.Default.Close else Icons.Default.MenuOpen,\\n                            contentDescription = \\\"Studio Menu\\\",\\n                            tint = if (isExpanded) Color(0xFF1E1400) else ResolveAmber,\\n                            modifier = Modifier.size(18.dp)\\n                        )\\n                    }\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n@Composable\\nprivate fun FloatingMenuItem(\\n    label: String,\\n    icon: ImageVector,\\n    accentColor: Color,\\n    onClick: () -> Unit,\\n    testTag: String,\\n    isSelected: Boolean = false\\n) {\\n    Surface(\\n        onClick = onClick,\\n        color = if (isSelected) Color(0xFF222B3D) else Color(0xFF141924),\\n        shape = RoundedCornerShape(20.dp),\\n        border = CardDefaults.outlinedCardBorder().copy(\\n            brush = androidx.compose.ui.graphics.SolidColor(\\n                if (isSelected) ResolveAmber else Color(0xFF2A3448)\\n            )\\n        ),\\n        shadowElevation = 6.dp,\\n        modifier = Modifier\\n            .height(38.dp)\\n            .testTag(testTag)\\n    ) {\\n        Row(\\n            verticalAlignment = Alignment.CenterVertically,\\n            modifier = Modifier.padding(horizontal = 12.dp, vertical = 6.dp)\\n        ) {\\n            Text(\\n                text = label,\\n                color = if (isSelected) ResolveAmber else TextPrimary,\\n                fontSize = 11.sp,\\n                fontWeight = if (isSelected) FontWeight.Bold else FontWeight.Medium\\n            )\\n            Spacer(modifier = Modifier.width(8.dp))\\n            Icon(\\n                imageVector = icon,\\n                contentDescription = label,\\n                tint = accentColor,\\n                modifier = Modifier.size(16.dp)\\n            )\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\",\"Description\":\"Create StudioFloatingActionMenu component with Speed Dial for collapsed studio dock navigation\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"TargetFile\":\"/app/src/main/java/com/example/ui/components/StudioFloatingActionMenu.kt\",\"toolAction\":\"Writing StudioFloatingActionMenu\",\"toolSummary\":\"Create StudioFloatingActionMenu component\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\331\016\n\326\016\001i\024}\023\327r/\023R0\005\226\0044uVv\346\324\372\017\025\222t\266\236\017\206\344\317\320\214a{\206C:\261\n\215\203,\251\356v\024\366\324\302d<\265n\330\216^\362VNR\346\346d\340H\roj\314R\342\371\354|\361\302\024b\251z\026\344\271\020\375\a\362[\223\246\031>JK%\004\037\253\264\267\330\361\323\303l\313@`\315\334`\263\275\363X!P\2179\034\334\346\215\033\276\307\252\350\207F\200!\024\205\347s\360J\270/}\342_\a\232\210\333\321Rr\322\212\260\205r\265\331\025b\264B\316\213y\267UhQz\273`\376\213\372;\332\223_\017.\244\2366R\242l%f>\353\317\217e\232b,!\200\3343\275B\201\352\276\023]\023\315\005l\315\367\220\376K7\251\226\336\253\027\232\025\316\302\273e\207\263\271\344\375\226:\037\277\275\005Ey\262\200^\364\2630A\311\333fK\202\304A\277o.-K\220:\006\264\335)\233\022B\030\367t\262\033CQ\271p\310\262{\311\030\370ERM\266H\314\324\321\224\026\321\216V\263?.\271\234c\t\364\347\003!\225\276\347\024\221\t\2127+\366\350f\2548\246\204\327\0039\035\317\006\364\341\241\nKl\361\342\212\370\375\271\237BT\230\240v\350/\311\036\365;\262l\256\276E\230y\336$\020wc\214A^a\263\376*6\f\203\030\3357\307-?*\240\036\035%\203\3454\210y\001Fv\337A\337\243{\025\235\206f\332\275F\2425\204\371\367\002\240\357C\262B\370\004U\002\364!\362\201\310\033\262=\024\217\037\317\277\334\261\332\243\360\366\371\250\250>\316CO\375\317\273\301\254\213\2073REc\001\342o:|\257\353]\271]\024r?F\314\376\025\266\202\316\232fS\225\353P\211D\267\347\035\v\372\236\245;\213a\257\200\000\272g\210u\3045\327R\271\002\374\374\243\020\375\225\251\0377\352\304\206y5=\364J\231\205\305\327N\031\034\206\022\016\205\354^\021\214y4<\252y\201\327t\ak:\'%\211Mhul\232K\375\213\344PbM\177\316`/\216L\354;\223\220W\267J\217#\243E\276\244\351\246\376\364\260\260\305+x\223b\3645\363\331\302r\a\263\356\325\020_5\360e\316\3134\376\037\327(\220\336\356\317o\017\365Yb:3L\341\201\v\222aT\'\221\232\241\360k\311\317J\255\331\246\034\372x,\022K\352k\366\370\031\262\347\026\373\202\362Ol\033\315\0