    thinking: "**Analyzing Screen Dimensions**\n\nI\'m currently focused on how `GradingStudioScreen.kt` handles screen dimensions. Specifically, I\'m examining the use of `BoxWithConstraints` to determine `widthDp` and `heightDp`. The `LaunchedEffect` is intriguing; I need to understand how `uiStateManager.updateScreenDimensions` uses these values. I\'m moving on to exploring the implications.\n\n\n**Investigating Viewport Rendering**\n\nI\'m now diving into the implications of `DockPresentationMode.COLLAPSED_FLOATING`. Specifically, I see the viewport is rendered full-width using a `Box` and `Column` arrangement. I\'m focusing on how the video player components, like `VideoPlayerView`, are placed and function within this structure, with `fillMaxSize` and the scroll modifiers. I am also examining the various callbacks.\n\n\n**Examining UI Elements**\n\nI\'m now analyzing the `StudioScreenContent` composable, paying close attention to its structure and how it manages UI elements. I\'m especially interested in the `StudioFloatingActionMenu` and `StudioFloatingToolSheet`. The `onBypassToggle` function and how it interacts with the `viewModel` to update settings is also of interest. I\'m focusing on the modifiers and alignment used to position these floating elements within the UI, particularly the anchoring to the bottom-end and the use of `windowInsetsPadding`.\n\n\n"
