    response: "### Responsive UI State Manager & Floating Studio Dock Implemented\n\n#### What was added:\n1. **`StudioUiStateManager.kt` (`com.example.ui.state`)**:\n   - Manages adaptive presentation modes (`COLLAPSED_FLOATING`, `DOCKED`, and `FLOATING_SHEET`) based on screen geometry and user overrides.\n   - Automatically collapses the studio dock on mobile screens (< 600dp width) to give the Samsung S24 Log video preview 100% full width and maximize visible stage area.\n   - Provides user toggle actions (`toggleDockMode()`, `collapseToFloating()`, `expandToDocked()`).\n\n2. **`StudioFloatingActionMenu.kt` (`com.example.ui.components`)**:\n   - DaVinci Resolve-styled floating HUD pill displaying active tool badge and quick adjustment launcher.\n   - Animated Speed Dial menu with direct shortcuts to:\n     - Expand to Static Dock\n     - A/B Bypass Grade Toggle\n     - Primary Wheels, Curves, 3D LUT Manager, Power Window, and Effects.\n   - Anchored with `WindowInsets.navigationBars` padding to prevent gesture bar clipping.\n\n3. **`StudioFloatingToolSheet.kt` (`com.example.ui.components`)**:\n   - Bottom sheet drawer opened from the floating action menu for making wheel/curve/LUT adjustments on the go without losing the full-width preview.\n   - Includes an \"Expand to Dock\" action to pin the dock if desired.\n\n4. **Full-Width Video Viewport Integration (`GradingStudioScreen.kt`)**:\n   - Screen cleanly branches between collapsed floating mode and docked mode.\n   - Added dock toggle button in the TopAppBar and dock header.\n   - Verified with unit tests (`testStudioUiStateManager`) and successful build compilation."
    modified_response: "### Responsive UI State Manager & Floating Studio Dock Implemented\n\n#### What was added:\n1. **`StudioUiStateManager.kt` (`com.example.ui.state`)**:\n   - Manages adaptive presentation modes (`COLLAPSED_FLOATING`, `DOCKED`, and `FLOATING_SHEET`) based on screen geometry and user overrides.\n   - Automatically collapses the studio dock on mobile screens (< 600dp width) to give the Samsung S24 Log video preview 100% full width and maximize visible stage area.\n   - Provides user toggle actions (`toggleDockMode()`, `collapseToFloating()`, `expandToDocked()`).\n\n2. **`StudioFloatingActionMenu.kt` (`com.example.ui.components`)**:\n   - DaVinci Resolve-styled floating HUD pill displaying active tool badge and quick adjustment launcher.\n   - Animated Speed Dial menu with direct shortcuts to:\n     - Expand to Static Dock\n     - A/B Bypass Grade Toggle\n     - Primary Wheels, Curves, 3D LUT Manager, Power Window, and Effects.\n   - Anchored with `WindowInsets.navigationBars` padding to prevent gesture bar clipping.\n\n3. **`StudioFloatingToolSheet.kt` (`com.example.ui.components`)**:\n   - Bottom sheet drawer opened from the floating action menu for making wheel/curve/LUT adjustments on the go without losing the full-width preview.\n   - Includes an \"Expand to Dock\" action to pin the dock if desired.\n\n4. **Full-Width Video Viewport Integration (`GradingStudioScreen.kt`)**:\n   - Screen cleanly branches between collapsed floating mode and docked mode.\n   - Added dock toggle button in the TopAppBar and dock header.\n   - Verified with unit tests (`testStudioUiStateManager`) and successful build compilation."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
