  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing Grading Presets**\n\nI\'ve got the Room configuration in `app/build.gradle.kts` sorted. Now, I\'m diving into the user request: adding a feature to save custom grading configurations as user presets. I\'m starting to sketch out the custom grading preset system design, focusing on the model first. I am considering what I will need.\n\n\n**Defining Preset Structures**\n\nI\'ve outlined the structure for `GradePreset.kt`, including UUIDs, names, descriptions, and detailed color grading settings (`ColorGradeSettings`). I\'m also planning to incorporate a `category` field and timestamps. This structure will encompass both built-in factory presets and user-created presets. I\'ve sketched out the initial data fields and their datatypes.\n\n\n**Implementing Preset Functionality**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the user interface and functionality for managing presets. I\'m designing a dedicated \"Presets\" modal and quick-access strip for the UI, including options to apply, save, preview, search, filter, and delete presets. I\'ve also planned a \"Save Look\" button. Finally, I\'m integrating these UI elements with the `GradingViewModel.kt` and `GradingStudioScreen.kt` classes.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_5823719785404877038"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"package com.example.model\\n\\nimport java.io.Serializable\\nimport java.util.UUID\\n\\n/**\\n * Complete custom color grading preset that can be saved and applied across any video clip.\\n */\\ndata class GradePreset(\\n    val id: String = UUID.randomUUID().toString(),\\n    val name: String,\\n    val description: String = \\\"\\\",\\n    val category: String = \\\"Custom\\\",\\n    val createdAt: Long = System.currentTimeMillis(),\\n    val isBuiltIn: Boolean = false,\\n    val settings: ColorGradeSettings\\n) : Serializable {\\n\\n    companion object {\\n        /**\\n         * Curated factory starter presets designed specifically for Samsung S24 Ultra Log 4K footage.\\n         */\\n        val DEFAULT_PRESETS: List<GradePreset> by lazy {\\n            listOf(\\n                GradePreset(\\n                    id = \\\"builtin_s24_golden_warmth\\\",\\n                    name = \\\"S24 Golden Hour Warmth\\\",\\n                    description = \\\"Warm amber lift, soft contrast, and Kodak 50D 35mm grain\\\",\\n                    category = \\\"Cinematic\\\",\\n                    isBuiltIn = true,\\n                    settings = ColorGradeSettings(\\n                        temperature = 0.35f,\\n                        tint = 0.05f,\\n                        contrast = 1.15f,\\n                        saturation = 1.12f,\\n                        activeLut = LutPreset.SAMSUNG_CINE_WARM,\\n                        lift = WheelValue(x = 0.12f, y = 0.08f, lum = -0.05f),\\n                        gain = WheelValue(x = 0.15f, y = 0.10f, lum = 0.08f),\\n                        effects = FilmEffects(\\n                            grain = FilmGrainSettings(enabled = true, strength = 0.28f, size = 1.0f, roughness = 0.35f),\\n                            halationIntensity = 0.25f\\n                        )\\n                    )\\n                ),\\n                GradePreset(\\n                    id = \\\"builtin_tokyo_cyber_neon\\\",\\n                    name = \\\"Cyber Neon Night\\\",\\n                    description = \\\"Deep crushed blacks, electric cyan shadows, and hot magenta highlights\\\",\\n                    category = \\\"Stylized\\\",\\n                    isBuiltIn = true,\\n                    settings = ColorGradeSettings(\\n                        contrast = 1.30f,\\n                        saturation = 1.25f,\\n                        activeLut = LutPreset.CYBER_NEON_NIGHT,\\n                        lift = WheelValue(x = -0.25f, y = 0.18f, lum = -0.12f),\\n                        gain = WheelValue(x = 0.20f, y = -0.15f, lum = 0.10f),\\n                        effects = FilmEffects(\\n                            grain = FilmGrainSettings(enabled = true, strength = 0.40f, size = 1.6f, roughness = 0.65f),\\n                            halationIntensity = 0.45f,\\n                            vignetteIntensity = 0.35f\\n                        )\\n                    )\\n                ),\\n                GradePreset(\\n                    id = \\\"builtin_clean_commercial_punch\\\",\\n                    name = \\\"Clean Commercial Punch\\\",\\n                    description = \\\"Neutral white point, +0.3 EV exposure pop, and razor sharp clarity\\\",\\n                    category = \\\"Commercial\\\",\\n                    isBuiltIn = true,\\n                    settings = ColorGradeSettings(\\n                        exposure = 0.3f,\\n                        contrast = 1.18f,\\n                        saturation = 1.15f,\\n                        activeLut = LutPreset.SAMSUNG_REC709_PUNCH,\\n                        lift = WheelValue(x = 0f, y = 0f, lum = -0.04f),\\n                        gain = WheelValue(x = 0f, y = 0f, lum = 0.05f),\\n                        effects = FilmEffects(\\n                            grain = FilmGrainSettings(enabled = false)\\n                        )\\n                    )\\n                ),\\n                GradePreset(\\n                    id = \\\"builtin_super8_vintage_grit\\\",\\n                    name = \\\"Super 8 Vintage Grit\\\",\\n                    description = \\\"Heavy 8mm analog grain, warm sepia shadows, and edge vignette\\\",\\n                    category = \\\"Vintage\\\",\\n                    isBuiltIn = true,\\n                    settings = ColorGradeSettings(\\n                        contrast = 1.22f,\\n                        saturation = 0.90f,\\n                        temperature = 0.25f,\\n                        activeLut = LutPreset.VINTAGE_SEPIA,\\n                        effects = FilmEffects(\\n                            grain = FilmGrainSettings(\\n                                enabled = true,\\n                                strength = 0.70f,\\n                                size = 2.4f,\\n                                roughness = 0.80f,\\n                                preset = FilmStockPreset.VINTAGE_8MM\\n                            ),\\n                            vignetteIntensity = 0.50f\\n                        )\\n                    )\\n                ),\\n                GradePreset(\\n                    id = \\\"builtin_silver_gelatin_bw\\\",\\n                    name = \\\"Silver Gelatin Noir\\\",\\n                    description = \\\"Monochrome high contrast film with dramatic tonal range\\\",\\n                    category = \\\"Monochrome\\\",\\n                    isBuiltIn = true,\\n                    settings = ColorGradeSettings(\\n                        contrast = 1.35f,\\n                        saturation = 0.0f,\\n                        activeLut = LutPreset.MONOCHROME_NOIR,\\n                        effects = FilmEffects(\\n                            grain = FilmGrainSettings(\\n                                enabled = true,\\n                                strength = 0.50f,\\n                                size = 1.4f,\\n                                roughness = 0.60f,\\n                 