    session_summary: "<summary>\n### 1. Task Overview\n- **User Request**: Add a feature to save custom grading configurations as user presets so users can quickly apply their favorite looks to different video clips.\n- **Success Criteria**:\n  - Ability to save the current color grading configuration (Lift/Gamma/Gain wheels, curves, Samsung Log transforms, LUT, halation, vignette, and film grain settings) as a named user preset.\n  - Ability to browse saved user presets along with curated built-in factory looks (\"S24 Golden Hour Warmth\", \"Cyber Neon Night\", \"Clean Commercial Punch\", \"Super 8 Vintage Grit\", \"Silver Gelatin Noir\").\n  - Instant one-tap application of any preset to the active video clip.\n  - Ability to delete custom user presets.\n  - Presets persisted across application restarts.\n- **Context & App Details**:\n  - App: `ResolveStudio` (`com.aistudio.colorgrader.samsunglog`)\n  - Target: Android 16 (API 36), Kotlin, Jetpack Compose, Material 3.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Progress\n- **Completed Components & Code (Pre-Compaction & Current Session)**:\n  - `app/src/main/java/com/example/model/ColorGradeState.kt`: Full color grading state including `WheelValue`, `RgbCurves`, `PowerWindowMask`, `FilmGrainSettings` (strength, size, roughness, monochrome, midtone bias), `FilmEffects`, and `LutPreset`.\n  - `app/src/main/java/com/example/color/FilmGrainProcessor.kt`: Multi-scale organic lattice noise synthesis, physical silver halide emulsion density modeling, and live texture loupe generator.\n  - `app/src/main/java/com/example/ui/components/FilmGrainControls.kt`: Interactive grain sliders (Strength, Size, Roughness, Midtone Bias), live 100% magnification texture loupe, and film stock presets (`35mm Kodak 50D`, `16mm Kodak 500T`, `8mm Super 8`, `65mm IMAX`).\n  - `app/src/main/java/com/example/ui/state/StudioUiStateManager.kt`: Adaptive screen size manager (`COMPACT`, `MEDIUM`, `EXPANDED`) and dock presentation manager (`COLLAPSED_FLOATING`, `DOCKED`, `FLOATING_SHEET`).\n  - `app/src/main/java/com/example/ui/components/StudioFloatingActionMenu.kt`: Speed dial floating action menu keeping video preview full-width on mobile.\n  - `app/src/main/java/com/example/ui/components/StudioFloatingToolSheet.kt`: Modal bottom sheet drawer for quick grading adjustments.\n  - `app/src/main/java/com/example/model/GradePreset.kt`: Model data class for `GradePreset` with unique UUID, name, description, category, timestamp, `isBuiltIn` flag, full `ColorGradeSettings` payload, and 5 curated starter presets (`DEFAULT_PRESETS`).\n  - `app/src/main/java/com/example/data/PresetRepository.kt`: Local persistence repository using `SharedPreferences` and `Moshi` JSON serialization to save and load user-created custom presets and merge them with built-in looks.\n- **In Progress**:\n  - Connecting `PresetRepository` into `GradingViewModel.kt` (`savedPresets` StateFlow, `applyPreset()`, `saveCurrentAsPreset()`, `deletePreset()`).\n  - Creating `PresetManagerDialog.kt` and/or quick preset carousel in `GradingStudioScreen.kt`.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Key Findings\n- Custom color grade configurations contain all active controls: Lift/Gamma/Gain/Offset wheels, RGB curves, exposure, temperature, tint, contrast, saturation, highlights/shadows, Samsung S24 Log CST parameters, active 3D LUT, and organic film grain parameters.\n- Using Moshi JSON persistence with `GradePreset` allows full serialization of complex grading states while guaranteeing local persistence across app sessions without external server dependencies.\n\n---\n\n### 4. Errors & Fixes (Exhaustive Session History)\n1. `generate_image` quota error (`generic::resource_exhausted`):\n   - *Fix*: Replaced with vector launcher icon assets and ImageMagick PNG rendering per skill fallback.\n2. `ExampleRobolectricTest` app name assertion failure:\n   - *Fix*: Updated expected string to `\"ResolveStudio\"`.\n3. Non-monotonic function failure in `testSamsungLogToLinear`:\n   - *Fix*: Standardized on continuous exponential inverse $x = \\frac{\\exp((y - d)/a) - c}{b}$.\n4. Missing closing braces in `GradingStudioScreen.kt` and `StudioDockContainer.kt`:\n   - *Fix*: Corrected brace nesting for floating action HUD and monitor modes row; subsequent `compile_applet` passed.\n5. Unit test failure in `testFilmGrainApplication`:\n   - *Error*: `java.lang.RuntimeException: Method rgb in android.graphics.Color not mocked`.\n   - *Root Cause*: JVM unit tests outside Robolectric cannot call static Android framework methods like `Color.rgb`.\n   - *Fix*: Replaced `AndroidColor.rgb` in `FilmGrainProcessor.kt` and `ExampleUnitTest.kt` with portable bitwise packaging `(0xFF shl 24) or (r shl 16) or (g shl 8) or b`. Verified with `gradle :app:testDebugUnitTest` (passed in 46s).\n\n---\n\n### 5. Active Context\n- `PresetRepository.kt` and `GradePreset.kt` are written and ready.\n- Need to expose `savedPresets`, `applyPreset`, `saveCurrentAsPreset`, and `deletePreset` in `GradingViewModel.kt`.\n- Need to build `PresetManagerDialog.kt` (or `SavePresetDialog.kt`) and integrate preset selection into `GradingStudioScreen.kt`.\n\n---\n\n### 6. Next Steps (Actionable Priority Order)\n1. **Update `GradingViewModel.kt`**:\n   - Add import `com.example.data.PresetRepository` and `com.example.model.GradePreset`.\n   - Instantiate `private val presetRepository = PresetRepository(application)`.\n   - Expose `val savedPresets: StateFlow<List<GradePreset>> = presetRepository.presets`.\n   - Implement `fun applyPreset(preset: GradePreset)`: calls `updateSettings(description = \"Apply Preset: ${preset.name}\", immediateCommit = true) { preset.settings }` and sets action toast.\n   - Implement `fun saveCurrentAsPreset(name: String, description: String, category: String)`: launches coroutine on `viewModelScope` calling `presetRepository.savePreset(...)`.\n   - Implement `fun deletePreset(id: String)`: launches coroutine calling `presetRepository.deletePreset(id)`.\n2. **Create `PresetDialogs.kt` (`app/src/main/java/com/example/ui/components/PresetDialogs.kt`)**:\n   - `SavePresetDialog`: Form modal allowing user to enter Name, Description, and Category (\"Cinematic\", \"Commercial\", \"Vintage\", \"Stylized\", \"Custom\").\n   - `PresetManagerDialog`: Preset browser dialog with category filter tabs (\"All\", \"Built-In\", \"My Saved Looks\"), search/list of preset cards showing color badges/settings summary, \"Apply Look\" button, delete button for user presets, and \"+ Save Current Look\" button.\n3. **Integrate into `GradingStudioScreen.kt`**:\n   - Collect `val savedPresets by viewModel.savedPresets.collectAsStateWithLifecycle()`.\n   - Add a \"Presets\" icon button (`Icons.Default.Bookmarks`) in `TopAppBar` with a badge showing preset count.\n   - Add quick preset drawer / strip or modal dialog trigger (`showPresetDialog = true`, `showSavePresetDialog = true`).\n   - Wire `onApplyPreset`, `onSavePreset`, `onDeletePreset`.\n4. **Add Unit Tests in `ExampleUnitTest.kt`**:\n   - Test preset creation, payload integrity, and default presets list.\n5. **Verification**:\n   - Run `compile_applet`.\n   - Run `gradle :app:testDebugUnitTest`.\n\n---\n\n### 7. Commitments & Constraints\n- Retain dark studio theme (`StudioBackground = #0C0E14`, `ResolveAmber = #F59E0B`).\n- Use Jetpack Compose exclusively with Material Design 3 guidelines.\n- Keep `MAJOR_CAPABILITY_SERVER_SIDE_GEMINI_API` in `metadata.json`.\n</summary>"
    included_step_index_start: 223
    included_step_index_end: 502
