  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining ViewModel Dependencies**\n\nI\'m working on the `GradingViewModel` implementation, specifically focusing on its dependencies. I\'ve pinpointed the need for a `PresetRepository` instance and a `StateFlow` to manage saved presets. The `applyPreset` function is also crucial. Now, I\'m structuring these dependencies within the view model.\n\n\n**Refining Preset Interactions**\n\nI\'ve just added the `applyPreset`, `saveCurrentAsPreset`, and `deletePreset` functions to the `GradingViewModel`. These will use the `PresetRepository` for data management and will update the history action toast. Specifically, `applyPreset` updates settings. Both `saveCurrentAsPreset` and `deletePreset` are wrapped in `viewModelScope.launch` blocks to avoid blocking the main thread.\n\n\n"
