  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Organization**\n\nI\'m impressed by the structure of `StudioDockContainer`. I\'m currently exploring the implications of adding `PRESETS(\"Presets\", Icons.Default.Bookmarks)` to `StudioToolTab`. My thoughts are now pivoting to the `StudioDockTabs`, noting that there are currently five tabs: `WHEELS`, `CURVES`, `LUTS`, and `MASK`.\n\n\n**Considering Integration**\n\nI\'m now focused on how smoothly the Presets tool integrates with existing components. It seems `StudioDockTabs`, `StudioDockContainer`, `StudioFloatingToolSheet`, and `StudioFloatingActionMenu` will incorporate it elegantly. The next step is fleshing out the Presets UI, specifically the `PresetManagerPanel`. I\'m envisioning a design inspired by DaVinci Resolve, including a header, filter chips, search, and preset cards with key information and actions.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
