  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing User Presets**\n\nI\'m now diving into the requirements for the User Presets feature. My focus is on updating `GradingViewModel.kt`. I\'ll need to inject `PresetRepository(application)` and expose `savedPresets` via a `StateFlow`. Finally, the `applyPreset` function is crucial for feature functionality.\n\n\n**Developing Preset Dialogs**\n\nI\'m making progress creating the dialogs. I\'ve started on `SavePresetDialog.kt` and `PresetManagerDialog.kt`, focusing on name, description, and category inputs. I\'m also ensuring input validation and visual cues are implemented. For the manager, I\'m integrating preset browsing, searching, and application with deletion capabilities. I\'m also adding a \"+ Save New Look\" CTA.\n\n\n"
