  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Positioning Presets Button**\n\nI\'ve decided on the `TopAppBar` `actions` placement for the Presets Button. It\'s going right after the History Stack Button and before the Scene Selector. Specifically, I\'m thinking of this: `IconButton(`. Now, I can move on to implementation.\n\n\n**Implementing Preset Button**\n\nI\'m now implementing the Presets button using `IconButton`. It will include a `BadgedBox` to indicate the number of saved presets. Inside, I\'m using `Icons.Default.Bookmarks` for the icon and setting the tint based on the `activeTab`. The button\'s size is 32.dp, and I\'ve added a test tag.\n\n\n"
