    response: "The custom user presets feature is fully implemented, verified, and tested:\n\n- **Save Custom Looks**: Capture active Lift/Gamma/Gain wheels, curves, Samsung Log transforms, 3D LUTs, power windows, and organic film grain into named presets with categories.\n- **Factory & User Preset Browser**: Access both curated built-in looks and custom saved looks directly from the Studio Dock \"Looks\" tab, the mobile floating tool sheet, or the top bar preset button.\n- **One-Tap Grade Application**: Instantly apply any preset to the live 4K S24 Log preview and video exporter with automated undo/redo history tracking.\n- **Persistent Storage**: Presets persist across app restarts using local JSON serialization.\n- **Verification**: Both `compile_applet` and local JVM unit tests passed with 100% success."
    modified_response: "The custom user presets feature is fully implemented, verified, and tested:\n\n- **Save Custom Looks**: Capture active Lift/Gamma/Gain wheels, curves, Samsung Log transforms, 3D LUTs, power windows, and organic film grain into named presets with categories.\n- **Factory & User Preset Browser**: Access both curated built-in looks and custom saved looks directly from the Studio Dock \"Looks\" tab, the mobile floating tool sheet, or the top bar preset button.\n- **One-Tap Grade Application**: Instantly apply any preset to the live 4K S24 Log preview and video exporter with automated undo/redo history tracking.\n- **Persistent Storage**: Presets persist across app restarts using local JSON serialization.\n- **Verification**: Both `compile_applet` and local JVM unit tests passed with 100% success."
