  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Color Wheels**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the color wheels within `StudioToolTab.WHEELS`. Specifically, I\'m examining the differences and relationships between the four ColorWheels (Lift, Gamma, Gain, Offset) and the core primary adjustment sliders, like Brightness, that you find in software like DaVinci Resolve. My thought is, perhaps, about their commonalities.\n\n\n"
