  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Slider Deck**\n\nI\'m now building the initial component, `PrimarySlidersDeck.kt`. It\'s an interactive, high-density deck for DaVinci Resolve Primaries sliders. The first slider I\'m creating is for Brightness, which translates to Exposure EV in this context. I\'m focusing on making it responsive and efficient.\n\n\n**Defining Primary Controls**\n\nI\'ve got the primary controls defined: Brightness/Lift, Contrast, Temperature, Tint, Saturation, Shadows, Highlights, and Color Boost. Each will have a quick-reset feature via double-click or button. I\'m aiming for color-coded tracks and readouts. There will be a \"PRIMARIES ADJUSTMENT BARS\" header and a \"Reset Sliders\" action. I\'m focusing on responsiveness and efficiency.\n\nI\'m now moving on to the node graph visualizer with a horizontal flow: [01 S24 LOG] \342\206\222 [02 WHEELS] \342\206\222 [03 CURVES] \342\206\222 [04 FILM FX] \342\206\222 [05 CST NODE]. The CST node is highlighted as active, with a bypass toggle. Input color space options are being designed.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_176731"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Append\":false,\"CodeContent\":\"package com.example.ui.components\\n\\nimport androidx.compose.foundation.background\\nimport androidx.compose.foundation.border\\nimport androidx.compose.foundation.clickable\\nimport androidx.compose.foundation.layout.*\\nimport androidx.compose.foundation.shape.CircleShape\\nimport androidx.compose.foundation.shape.RoundedCornerShape\\nimport androidx.compose.material.icons.Icons\\nimport androidx.compose.material.icons.filled.RestartAlt\\nimport androidx.compose.material.icons.filled.Tune\\nimport androidx.compose.material3.*\\nimport androidx.compose.runtime.Composable\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.Alignment\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.Modifier\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.draw.clip\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.graphics.Color\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.platform.testTag\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.text.font.FontFamily\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.text.font.FontWeight\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.unit.dp\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.unit.sp\\nimport com.example.model.ColorGradeSettings\\nimport com.example.ui.theme.*\\n\\n/**\\n * DaVinci Resolve Studio Primary Adjustment Sliders Deck.\\n * Hosts the 8 core grading parameters:\\n * Brightness (Exposure EV), Contrast, Temperature, Tint, Saturation, Shadows, Highlights, and Color Boost.\\n */\\n@Composable\\nfun PrimarySlidersDeck(\\n    settings: ColorGradeSettings,\\n    onSettingsChange: (description: String, transform: (ColorGradeSettings) -> ColorGradeSettings) -> Unit,\\n    modifier: Modifier = Modifier\\n) {\\n    Card(\\n        modifier = modifier\\n            .fillMaxWidth()\\n            .testTag(\\\"primary_sliders_deck\\\")\\n            .padding(vertical = 4.dp),\\n        colors = CardDefaults.cardColors(containerColor = Color(0xFF10131B)),\\n        shape = RoundedCornerShape(10.dp),\\n        border = CardDefaults.outlinedCardBorder().copy(brush = androidx.compose.ui.graphics.SolidColor(Color(0xFF222B3D)))\\n    ) {\\n        Column(\\n            modifier = Modifier\\n                .fillMaxWidth()\\n                .padding(8.dp)\\n        ) {\\n            // Header\\n            Row(\\n                verticalAlignment = Alignment.CenterVertically,\\n                horizontalArrangement = Arrangement.SpaceBetween,\\n                modifier = Modifier\\n                    .fillMaxWidth()\\n                    .padding(horizontal = 4.dp, vertical = 2.dp)\\n            ) {\\n                Row(verticalAlignment = Alignment.CenterVertically) {\\n                    Icon(\\n                        imageVector = Icons.Default.Tune,\\n                        contentDescription = null,\\n                        tint = ResolveAmber,\\n                        modifier = Modifier.size(13.dp)\\n                    )\\n                    Spacer(modifier = Modifier.width(6.dp))\\n                    Text(\\n                        text = \\\"PRIMARY ADJUSTMENT BARS\\\",\\n                        color = TextPrimary,\\n                        fontSize = 9.5.sp,\\n                        fontWeight = FontWeight.Black,\\n                        letterSpacing = 0.5.sp\\n                    )\\n                }\\n\\n                // Reset All Primary Sliders\\n                Text(\\n                    text = \\\"RESET ALL\\\",\\n                    color = ResolveAmber,\\n                    fontSize = 8.5.sp,\\n                    fontWeight = FontWeight.Bold,\\n                    fontFamily = FontFamily.Monospace,\\n                    modifier = Modifier\\n                        .clip(RoundedCornerShape(4.dp))\\n                        .clickable {\\n                            onSettingsChange(\\\"Reset Primary Sliders\\\") {\\n                                it.copy(\\n                                    brightness = 0.0f,\\n                                    exposure = 0.0f,\\n                                    contrast = 1.0f,\\n                                    temperature = 0.0f,\\n                                    tint = 0.0f,\\n                                    saturation = 1.0f,\\n                                    shadows = 0.0f,\\n                                    highlights = 0.0f,\\n                                    colorBoost = 0.0f\\n                                )\\n                            }\\n                        }\\n                        .padding(horizontal = 6.dp, vertical = 2.dp)\\n                        .testTag(\\\"reset_primary_sliders_button\\\")\\n                )\\n            }\\n\\n            Spacer(modifier = Modifier.height(6.dp))\\n\\n            // 1. Brightness / Exposure Slider\\n            ResolveSliderItem(\\n                label = \\\"Brightness / Exposure\\\",\\n                value = settings.exposure,\\n                valueRange = -2.0f..2.0f,\\n                defaultValue = 0.0f,\\n                formattedValue = String.format(\\\"%+.2f EV\\\", settings.exposure),\\n                activeColor = ResolveCyan,\\n                onValueChange = { newVal ->\\n                    onSettingsChange(\\\"Adjust Brightness\\\") { it.copy(exposure = newVal) }\\n                },\\n                testTag = \\\"slider_brightness\\\"\\n            )\\n\\n            // 2. Contrast Slider\\n            ResolveSliderItem(\\n                label = \\\"Contrast\\\",\\n                value = settings.contrast,\\n                valueRange = 0.5f..1.8f,\\n                defaultValue = 1.0f,\\n                formattedValue = String.format(\\\"%.2f\\\", settings.contrast),\\n                activeColor = Color.White,\\n                onValueChange = { newVal ->\\n                    onSettingsChange(\\\"Adjust Contrast\\\") { it.copy(contrast = newVal) }\\n                },\\n                testTag = \\\"slider_contrast\\\"\\n            )\\n\\n            // 3. Temperature Slider\\n            ResolveSliderItem(\\n                label = \\\"Temperature (WB)\\\",\\n                value = settings.temperature,\\n                valueRange = -1.0f..1.0f,\\n                defaultValue = 0.0f,\\n                formattedValue = if (settings.temperature > 0) \\\"+${(settings.temperature * 100).toInt()}\\\" else \\\"${(settings.temperature * 100).toInt()}\\\",\\n                activeColor = Color(0xFFF59E0B),\\n                onValueChange = { newVal ->\\n                    onSettingsChange(\\\"Adjust Temperature\\\") { it.copy(temperature = newVal) }\\n                },\\n                testTag = \\\"slider_temperature\\\"\\n            )\\n\\n            // 4. Tint Slider\\n            ResolveSliderItem(\\n                label = \\\"Tint (Green / Magenta)\\\",\\n                value = settings.tint,\\n                valueRange = -1.0f..1.0f,\\n                defaultValue = 0.0f,\\n                formattedValue = if (settings.tint > 0) \\\"+${(settings.tint * 100).toInt()}\\\" else \\\"${(settings.tint * 100).toInt()}\\\",\\n                activeColor = Color(0xFFEC4899),\\n                onValueChange = { newVal ->\\n                    onSettingsChange(\\\"Adjust Tint\\\") { it.copy(tint = newVal) }\\n                },\\n                testTag = \\\"slider_tint\\\"\\n            )\\n\\n            // 5. Saturation Slider\\n            ResolveSliderItem(\\n                label = \\\"Saturation\\\",\\n                value = settings.saturation,\\n                valueRange = 0.0f..2.0f,\\n                defaultValue = 1.0f,\\n                formattedValue = \\\"${(settings.saturation * 100).toInt()}%\\\",\\n                activeColor = Color(0xFF10B981),\\n                onValueChange = { newVal ->\\n                    onSettingsChange(\\\"Adjust Saturation\\\") { it.copy(saturation = newVal) }\\n                },\\n                testTag = \\\"slider_saturation\\\"\\n            )\\n\\n            // 6. Color Boost (Smart Vibrance)\\n            ResolveSliderItem(\\n                label = \\\"Color Boost\\\",\\n                value = settings.colorBoost,\\n                valueRange = -1.0f..1.0f,\\n                defaultValue = 0.0f,\\n                formattedValue = if (settings.colorBoost > 0) \\\"+${(settings.colorBoost * 100).toInt()}\\\" else \\\"${(settings.colorBoost * 100).toInt()}\\\",\\n                activeColor = Color(0xFF8B5CF6),\\n                onValueChange = { newVal ->\\n                    onSettingsChange(\\\"Adjust Color Boost\\\") { it.copy(colorBoost = newVal) }\\n                },\\n                testTag = \\\"slider_color_boost\\\"\\n            )\\n\\n            // 7. Shadows Recovery Slider\\n            ResolveSliderItem(\\n                label = \\\"Shadows\\\",\\n                value = settings.shadows,\\n                valueRange = -1.0f..1.0f,\\n                defaultValue = 0.0f,\\n                formattedValue = if (settings.shadows > 0) \\\"+${(settings.shadows * 100).toInt()}\\\" else \\\"${(settings.shadows * 100).toInt()}\\\",\\n                activeColor = Color(0xFF38BDF8),\\n                onValueChange = { newVal ->\\n                    onSettingsChange(\\\"Adjust Shadows\\\") { it.copy(shadows = newVal) }\\n                },\\n                testTag = \\\"slider_shadows\\\"\\n            )\\n\\n            // 8. Highlights Compression Slider\\n            ResolveSliderItem(\\n                label = \\\"Highlights\\\",\\n                value = settings.highlights,\\n                valueRange = -1.0f..1.0f,\\n                defaultValue = 0.0f,\\n                formattedValue = if (settings.highlights > 0) \\\"+${(settings.highlights * 100).toInt()}\\\" else \\\"${(settings.highlights * 100).toInt()}\\\",\\n                activeColor = Color(0xFFFB923C),\\n                onValueChange = { newVal ->\\n                    onSettingsChange(\\\"Adjust Highlights\\\") { it.copy(highlights = newVal) }\\n                },\\n                testTag = \\\"slider_highlights\\\"\\n            )\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n@Composable\\nprivate fun ResolveSliderItem(\\n    label: String,\\n    value: Float,\\n    valueRange: ClosedFloatingPointRange<Float>,\\n    defaultValue: Float,\\n    formattedValue: String,\\n    activeColor: Color,\\n    onValueChange: (Float) -> Unit,\\n    testTag: String\\n) {\\n    Row(\\n        verticalAlignment = Alignment.CenterVertically,\\n        modifier = Modifier\\n            .fillMaxWidth()\\n            .height(28.dp)\\n            .padding(horizontal = 4.dp)\\n    ) {\\n        // Label\\n        Text(\\n            text = label,\\n            color = TextSecondary,\\n            fontSize = 9.5.sp,\\n            fontWeight = FontWeight.Medium,\\n            modifier = Modifier.width(115.dp)\\n        )\\n\\n        // Slider Bar\\n        Slider(\\n            value = value,\\n            onValueChange = onValueChange,\\n            valueRange = valueRange,\\n            colors = SliderDefaults.colors(\\n                thumbColor = activeColor,\\n                activeTrackColor = activeColor,\\n                inactiveTrackColor = Color(0xFF1E2638)\\n            ),\\n            modifier = Modifier\\n                .weight(1f)\\n                .height(24.dp)\\n                .testTag(testTag)\\n        )\\n\\n        Spacer(modifier = Modifier.width(6.dp))\\n\\n        // Formatted numeric value readout\\n        Text(\\n            text = formattedValue,\\n            color = if (value != defaultValue) activeColor else TextMuted,\\n            fontSize = 9.sp,\\n            fontWeight = FontWeight.Bold,\\n            fontFamily = FontFamily.Monospace,\\n            modifier = Modifier.width(48.dp)\\n        )\\n\\n        // Reset icon button\\n        IconButton(\\n            onClick = { onValueChange(defaultValue) },\\n            enabled = value != defaultValue,\\n            modifier = Modifier.size(20.dp)\\n        ) {\\n            Icon(\\n                imageVector = Icons.Default.RestartAlt,\\n                contentDescription = \\\"Reset\\\",\\n                tint = if (value != defaultValue) activeColor.copy(alpha = 0.7f) else Color(0xFF283244),\\n                modifier = Modifier.size(12.dp)\\n            )\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\",\"Description\":\"Create PrimarySlidersDeck component with brightness, contrast, temperature, tint, saturation, shadows, highlights, and color boost\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"TargetFile\":\"/app/src/main/java/com/example/ui/components/PrimarySlidersDeck.kt\",\"toolAction\":\"Creating PrimarySlidersDeck\",\"toolSummary\":\"Create PrimarySlidersDeck component\"}"
