  checkpoint {
    checkpoint_index: 2
    session_summary: "<summary>\n### 1. Task Overview\n- **User Requests**:\n  1. Create an interactive Bezier-based masking tool (Power Windows) that allows users to create circular, rectangular, or custom-drawn masks for localized color adjustments.\n  2. Implement authentic film grain and build the **7 most famous Fujifilm recipe LUTs** specifically tuned for Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra 10-bit Log footage:\n     - Classic Chrome, Classic Negative, Nostalgic Negative, Velvia (Vivid), Provia (Standard), Astia (Soft), and ACROS (+Red/Yellow Filter).\n  3. Provide comprehensive instructions on how to make the app public and downloadable from the Google Play Store.\n- **Environment**:\n  - Android 16 (API 36), Kotlin, Jetpack Compose, Material Design 3.\n  - Package: `com.aistudio.colorgrader.samsunglog` (`com.example`)\n  - App Name: `ResolveStudio` (sync with `metadata.json`).\n  - Shared App URL: `https://ais-pre-eayknkklreuscrpldkkjex-402014018267.europe-west3.run.app`\n\n---\n\n### 2. Progress\n- **Completed Components & Features in Previous Turns**:\n  - `ColorWheel.kt`: Lift, Gamma, Gain, Offset 3-way color wheels.\n  - `PrimarySlidersDeck.kt`: Full primaries adjustment deck (Exposure/Brightness EV, Contrast with pivot, Kelvin Temperature, Tint, Saturation, Shadows recovery, Highlights compression, Color Boost).\n  - `CstNodeSettings.kt` & `CstNodePanel.kt`: DaVinci Resolve Color Space Transform (CST) final output node with DWG / S24 BT.2020 to Rec.709/DCI-P3, DaVinci saturation-preserving tone mapping, and gamut saturation compression.\n  - `FilmGrainProcessor.kt` & `FilmGrainControls.kt`: Multi-scale organic lattice noise and silver halide emulsion response.\n  - `PresetRepository.kt`, `PresetManagerPanel.kt`, `PresetDialogs.kt`: Cross-session look preset persistence.\n  - Unit tests in `ExampleUnitTest.kt`: Verified CST, False Color IRE zones, primary sliders, and preset JSON serialization.\n  - Clean build verified: `compile_applet` passed; `gradle :app:testDebugUnitTest` passed (33 actionable tasks); `gradle :app:assembleDebug` built signed 23MB APK at `app/build/outputs/apk/debug/app-debug.apk`.\n- **In Progress for Current User Request**:\n  - `ColorGradeState.kt`: Extending `MaskType` with `CUSTOM_BEZIER`, adding `BezierControlPoint` data class, and expanding `PowerWindowMask`.\n  - Adding 7 Fujifilm recipe presets to `LutCategory` and `LutPreset`.\n  - Math in `SamsungLogColorScience.kt`: Adding `evaluateBezierMask` and mathematical LUT formulas for all 7 Fujifilm simulations.\n  - Touch interaction in `MaskingOverlay.kt` & controls in `PowerWindowControls.kt`.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Key Findings & Design Decisions\n- **Bezier Masking Architecture**:\n  - Control points require an anchor point $(x, y)$ and two tangent handles (`handleInX, handleInY`, `handleOutX, handleOutY`) normalized to $[0, 1]$.\n  - Default Bezier shape initializes as a 4-point smooth diamond/oval.\n  - Pixel evaluation in `SamsungLogColorScience.kt`: Evaluates cubic Bezier curves ($B(t) = (1-t)^3 P_0 + 3(1-t)^2 t P_1 + 3(1-t) t^2 P_2 + t^3 P_3$), calculates point-in-polygon winding number/ray casting, and measures orthogonal distance to the curve boundary with Hermite smoothstep feathering.\n  - Interactive overlay handles drag gestures on anchor nodes, tangent handles, and viewport tapping to insert new vertices or delete selected vertices.\n- **7 Famous Fujifilm Recipes for Samsung Log**:\n  1. *Classic Chrome*: Soft documentary tonality, muted greens, deep navy blues, warm skin highlights.\n  2. *Classic Negative*: Retro Superia 400 look, high contrast, magenta shadow bias, cyan highlight roll-off.\n  3. *Nostalgic Negative*: 1970s American New Color, rich amber highlights, warm lifted shadows.\n  4. *Velvia 50*: High dynamic landscape slide film, saturated reds/greens, deep blacks.\n  5. *Provia 100F*: Standard balanced reversal film with true-to-life neutral palette.\n  6. *Astia*: Soft portrait slide film, gentle contrast, radiant glowing skin tones.\n  7. *ACROS (+Filter)*: Acros monochrome film simulation with rich silver halide tonal gradation and deep contrast.\n\n---\n\n### 4. Errors & Fixes (Exhaustive Session History)\n1. `generate_image` quota error (`generic::resource_exhausted`):\n   - *Fix*: Replaced with vector launcher icon assets and ImageMagick PNG rendering per skill fallback.\n2. `ExampleRobolectricTest` app name assertion failure:\n   - *Fix*: Updated expected string to `\"ResolveStudio\"`.\n3. Non-monotonic function failure in `testSamsungLogToLinear`:\n   - *Fix*: Standardized on continuous exponential inverse $x = \\frac{\\exp((y - d)/a) - c}{b}$.\n4. Unit test failure in `testFilmGrainApplication`:\n   - *Error*: `java.lang.RuntimeException: Method rgb in android.graphics.Color not mocked`.\n   - *Fix*: Replaced `AndroidColor.rgb` with bitwise packaging `(0xFF shl 24) or (r shl 16) or (g shl 8) or b`.\n5. `CstNodePanel.kt:566:30 Unresolved reference \'scale\'`:\n   - *Fix*: Imported `androidx.compose.ui.draw.scale` and removed redundant custom extension.\n\n---\n\n### 5. Active Context\n- Working in root directory.\n- `ColorGradeState.kt` is currently open for editing.\n- Target changes are isolated to `ColorGradeState.kt`, `SamsungLogColorScience.kt`, `MaskingOverlay.kt`, `PowerWindowOverlay.kt`, `LutManager.kt`, and `ExampleUnitTest.kt`.\n\n---\n\n### 6. Next Steps (Actionable Priority Order)\n1. **Update `app/src/main/java/com/example/model/ColorGradeState.kt`**:\n   - Add `CUSTOM_BEZIER` to `MaskType`.\n   - Define `data class BezierControlPoint(...)` and `defaultBezierPoints()`.\n   - Add `bezierPoints`, `isClosed`, `selectedPointIndex` to `PowerWindowMask`.\n   - Add `LutCategory.FUJIFILM(\"Fujifilm Film Simulations\")`.\n   - Add the 7 Fujifilm presets to `LutPreset`:\n     - `FUJI_CLASSIC_CHROME`\n     - `FUJI_CLASSIC_NEGATIVE`\n     - `FUJI_NOSTALGIC_NEGATIVE`\n     - `FUJI_VELVIA`\n     - `FUJI_PROVIA`\n     - `FUJI_ASTIA`\n     - `FUJI_ACROS`\n2. **Update `app/src/main/java/com/example/color/SamsungLogColorScience.kt`**:\n   - Add `evaluateBezierMask(u, v, mask)` helper to calculate point-in-polygon and edge distance for smoothstep feathering.\n   - Wire `MaskType.CUSTOM_BEZIER` into `evaluateMask()`.\n   - In `applyLutPreset()`, add cases for all 7 Fujifilm simulations with calibrated color curves and matrix shifts.\n3. **Update `app/src/main/java/com/example/ui/components/MaskingOverlay.kt`**:\n   - Add Bezier rendering on Canvas (`drawPath`, circle nodes for anchors, diamond nodes and tangent lines for handles).\n   - Add gesture detection for dragging anchor points and tangent handles.\n   - Add quick on-screen toolbar for Bezier editing: \"+ Add Point\", \"- Delete Point\", \"Close/Open\", \"Reset\", \"Invert\", \"Matte\".\n4. **Update `app/src/main/java/com/example/ui/components/PowerWindowOverlay.kt`**:\n   - Include `Custom Bezier` in the shape selector tab row.\n   - Expose Bezier control parameters (point counter, reset button, add/delete actions).\n5. **Update `app/src/main/java/com/example/ui/components/LutManager.kt`**:\n   - Ensure the `FUJIFILM` category tab displays the 7 Fujifilm recipe cards with their color badges and grain pairing tags.\n6. **Add Unit Tests in `app/src/test/java/com/example/ExampleUnitTest.kt`**:\n   - Test Bezier mask evaluation (point inside, outside, feathered boundary).\n   - Test all 7 Fujifilm recipe LUTs for legal Rec.709 outputs and grayscale output on ACROS.\n7. **Verification**:\n   - Run `compile_applet`.\n   - Run `gradle :app:testDebugUnitTest`.\n   - Run `gradle :app:assembleDebug`.\n8. **Final Deliverable**:\n   - Detailed Google Play Store publishing guide covering keystore signing, Play Console setup, store listing, policy compliance, and test track rollout.\n\n---\n\n### 7. Commitments & Constraints\n- Keep `name` in `metadata.json` and `res/values/strings.xml` synced to `\"ResolveStudio\"`.\n- Do not remove `MAJOR_CAPABILITY_SERVER_SIDE_GEMINI_API` from `metadata.json`.\n- Retain dark studio theme (`StudioBackground = #0C0E14`, `ResolveAmber = #F59E0B`).\n- Use Jetpack Compose and Material 3 exclusively.\n</summary>"
    included_step_index_start: 210
    included_step_index_end: 509
