  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Implementing Film Recipes**\n\nI\'ve made good progress! I\'ve incorporated `evaluateBezierMask` and `evaluateMask` within `SamsungLogColorScience.kt`, supporting `MaskType.CUSTOM_BEZIER`. I\'ve also successfully implemented seven Fujifilm film recipe LUTs tailored specifically for Samsung S24 Log! Now, I need to update `LutManager.kt`.\n\n\n**Adding Preset Gradients**\n\nI\'m now integrating gradient data for all seven Fujifilm presets into `LutManager.kt`. Each preset will now have an associated gradient, enhancing the visual representation of their color profiles. I\'ve defined gradients for Fuji Classic Chrome, Classic Negative, Nostalgic Negative, Velvia, Provia, Astia, and Acros. This will further improve the user experience and visual understanding.\n\n\n"
