  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Mobile TopBar**\n\nI\'ve been looking closely at the `TopAppBar` component, specifically on mobile screens within the 360-400dp width range. The title is displaying \"RESOLVE STUDIO\" in ResolveAmber, and it has the \"S24 LOG\" badge. The action icons present are undo, redo, history and presets, all at 32dp.\n\n\n**Diagnosing UI Layout**\n\nI\'ve pinpointed the root cause! The \"RESOLVE\" and \"STUDIO\" title components are separate texts that wrap on narrow screens due to the limited space. The numerous action icons exacerbate the issue by further constricting the title area, leading to the undesirable wrapping behavior the user reported. I now need to determine the best approach for professional mobile responsiveness in this instance.\n\n\n**Implementing UI Refinement**\n\nI\'m now implementing the UI refinements! I\'ve decided to use a single `Text` with `buildAnnotatedString` for the brand title to ensure it never wraps. I am also considering a sleek logo mark, with Resolve in white and Studio in Amber. For the actions, I will group the primary ones (Undo, Redo, Bypass/Export) and move the secondary actions (Presets, History, Reset, Dock mode) into a \"More Options\" menu to avoid crowding.\n\n\n"
