  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Implementing Overflow Menu**\n\nI\'ve introduced a `showStudioOverflowMenu` variable using `remember { mutableStateOf(false) }`. Additionally, I\'m now implementing the `title` within `TopAppBar` using `buildAnnotatedString` to enable more styling options.\n\n\n**Refining Top Bar Elements**\n\nI\'ve crafted a custom title using `buildAnnotatedString`, giving \"RESOLVE STUDIO\" a distinct visual style with differing colors and weights. Adjacent to this, I\'ve styled a \"S24 LOG\" box for added information. Moreover, I\'m integrating several action buttons into the top app bar, including undo, redo, scenes (with a dropdown), an amber-background export button, and a \"More\" menu displaying look presets.\n\n\n"
