    thinking: "**Analyzing UI Updates**\n\nI\'ve been adding state within `GradingStudioScreen.kt` using `var showMoreMenu`. I\'m focusing now on redesigning the `TopAppBar`. I\'m considering the structure and its components. I need to be sure the design aligns with the overall aesthetic, and is user friendly.\n\n\n**Refining App Bar Design**\n\nI\'m now implementing the Resolve Studio brand logo into the TopAppBar. I\'ve centered the content and added the logo with the brand colors and typography. I\'m focusing on making the logo stand out, while also maintaining a clean aesthetic.\n\n\n**Incorporating Brand Details**\n\nI\'ve added specific visual elements to enhance the app\'s branding within the top app bar. I\'m focusing on text styling such as `letterSpacing` and `maxLines`. I\'ve also incorporated a compact \"S24 LOG\" badge for a clear visual cue. I\'m tweaking the design to ensure it is crisp and clear, employing appropriate colors, typography, and borders for visual distinction.\n\n\n**Adding Undo/Redo Functionality**\n\nI\'ve added the undo and redo buttons with their functionality. I\'m focusing on ensuring they are properly enabled or disabled based on the state of the undo/redo stacks. I\'ve used icons for these actions, with specific tints for clarity, indicating whether an action is possible. I\'ve also added test tags for UI testing.\n\n\n**Implementing Scene Menu**\n\nI\'ve added a scene selector menu, complete with an import option. I\'ve designed the button and dropdown using icons and styling consistent with the app\'s overall aesthetic. I\'m focusing on ensuring it\'s accessible and intuitive, using test tags for easy UI testing. I\'ve made the menu dismiss on request.\n\n\n**Adding Video Import**\n\nI\'ve integrated a video import option into the scene menu, using a video picker launcher. I\'m focusing on ensuring seamless accessibility, complete with UI testing tags. I\'ve designed the UI to align with the Resolve Studio aesthetics.\n\n\n**Adding Export Button**\n\nI\'ve added an export button, implementing its functionality to trigger an export dialog. I\'ve designed the button using the app\'s style guidelines, focusing on color and shape to ensure consistency. I\'ve also incorporated a specific test tag for the UI testing of this feature. I\'m focusing on ensuring it functions without issue.\n\n\n**Adding More Options Menu**\n\nI\'m now integrating a \"More Options\" menu, complete with an icon button. I\'m focusing on ensuring its seamless integration within the `TopAppBar`. I\'ve added a `DropdownMenu` using the `MoreVert` icon. I\'m focusing on its display and dismissal. The button now uses test tags for proper testing.\n\n\n**Adding Preset Manager**\n\nI\'ve added a dropdown menu item for look presets, using an icon and count label. I\'m focusing on ensuring its functionality, making sure it opens the preset manager dialog when clicked. I\'ve also incorporated a test tag for UI testing and am designing it with `StudioSurfaceVariant`.\n\n\n**Adding Dock Mode Toggle**\n\nI\'ve integrated a dock mode toggle within the \"More Options\" menu. I\'m focusing on providing users with clear visual feedback based on the current dock mode. I\'ve used text and icons for two states: collapsed or pinned. I\'ve also incorporated a test tag for seamless UI testing.\n\n\n**Adding Reset Grade Option**\n\nI\'ve integrated a \"Reset Grade to Default\" option into the \"More Options\" menu. I\'m focusing on making this a standout option, so it has a distinct visual style using the color `Color(0xFFF87171)`. I\'m working to integrate a restart icon, ensuring the color scheme and the icon complement each other. I\'ve also incorporated a test tag for seamless UI testing.\n\n\n**Optimizing TopAppBar Layout**\n\nI\'m now refining the layout to ensure the title doesn\'t wrap and the actions remain compact. I\'ve calculated the action width, and ensured the title has ample space on all standard phone screens, maintaining a minimum width of 180dp. I\'m focusing on consistency in the UI. I\'m leveraging existing `testTag`s for streamlined testing.\n\n\n"
