    thinking: "**Examining VideoPlayerView**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the UI elements within `VideoPlayerView.kt`. Specifically, I\'m examining the top bar controls: timecode display, the `showFalseColor` button, the `splitPosition` button, and the `HOLD BYPASS` button. I\'m exploring their individual functionalities and interactions within the overall view.\n\n\n**Designing Histogram Overlay**\n\nI\'ve been thinking about enhancing the `Main Video Surface Box`. Currently, there\'s no real-time histogram scope overlay, which is a key feature in professional video grading. I\'ve designed a dedicated \"Real-Time Histogram Scope Overlay\" for the `VideoPlayerView`. It will have a toggle button using `Icons.Default.BarChart` with testTag `histogram_overlay_toggle`. It will also allow toggling between PIP and strip formats, and the choice of histogram channels.\n\n\n"
