  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Component Features**\n\nI\'m focusing now on outlining the specific features for the new `RealtimeHistogramOverlay` component. I\'m starting by establishing its purpose and expected responsiveness within the application. The objective is to create a dedicated, ultra-responsive, and visually appealing component to meet functional requirements. I\'ve begun to list the required features.\n\n\n**Visualizing Color Data**\n\nI\'m now diving into the specifics of how the histogram will visually represent color data. I\'m prioritizing three modes: a high-contrast Luma silhouette, an RGB overlay with additive glow, and a combined Luma/RGB view. Also, it\'s crucial to ensure visual clarity and a clean user experience by implementing professional exposure and dynamic range graticules. Further, I am considering live telemetry stats.\n\n\n**Designing HUD Functionality**\n\nI\'m now fully immersed in the design of the Interactive HUD capabilities. Specifically, I\'m thinking about the positioning options: top-left, top-right, or bottom-right, and the sizing toggles: compact, expanded, and full-width. I\'ve also outlined the channel switcher (Luma vs RGB), and the Log/Graded toggle for quick A/B comparisons. Finally, a close button has been included. Now, I will look at where in the code to implement this in `VideoPlayerView.kt` and `GradingStudioScreen.kt`.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_182048"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"package com.example.ui.components\\n\\nimport android.graphics.Bitmap\\nimport androidx.compose.animation.*\\nimport androidx.compose.foundation.Canvas\\nimport androidx.compose.foundation.background\\nimport androidx.compose.foundation.border\\nimport androidx.compose.foundation.clickable\\nimport androidx.compose.foundation.layout.*\\nimport androidx.compose.foundation.shape.CircleShape\\nimport androidx.compose.foundation.shape.RoundedCornerShape\\nimport androidx.compose.material.icons.Icons\\nimport androidx.compose.material.icons.filled.*\\nimport androidx.compose.material3.*\\nimport androidx.compose.runtime.*\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.Alignment\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.Modifier\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.draw.clip\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.geometry.Offset\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.graphics.Brush\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.graphics.Color\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.graphics.Path\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.graphics.PathEffect\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.graphics.drawscope.Stroke\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.platform.testTag\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.text.font.FontFamily\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.text.font.FontWeight\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.unit.dp\\nimport androidx.compose.ui.unit.sp\\nimport com.example.color.SamsungLogColorScience\\nimport com.example.ui.theme.*\\n\\nenum class HistogramDisplayMode {\\n    LUMINANCE,\\n    RGB_PARADE,\\n    COMBINED\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Professional real-time Histogram Scope Overlay for 4K Samsung S24 Log footage.\\n * Renders on-screen over the video viewport (cinema monitor HUD style) with IRE graticule,\\n * luminance distribution, RGB channel separation, and live shadow/highlight clipping alerts.\\n */\\n@Composable\\nfun RealtimeHistogramOverlay(\\n    gradedBitmap: Bitmap?,\\n    rawBitmap: Bitmap?,\\n    onClose: () -> Unit,\\n    modifier: Modifier = Modifier\\n) {\\n    var displayMode by remember { mutableStateOf(HistogramDisplayMode.COMBINED) }\\n    var inspectRawLog by remember { mutableStateOf(false) } // Compare flat Log vs graded Rec.709\\n    var isExpanded by remember { mutableStateOf(false) }\\n\\n    val activeBitmap = if (inspectRawLog && rawBitmap != null) rawBitmap else gradedBitmap\\n    if (activeBitmap == null) return\\n\\n    val histogram = remember(activeBitmap) {\\n        SamsungLogColorScience.calculateHistogram(activeBitmap)\\n    }\\n\\n    val overlayWidth = if (isExpanded) 250.dp else 170.dp\\n    val overlayHeight = if (isExpanded) 140.dp else 95.dp\\n\\n    Card(\\n        modifier = modifier\\n            .width(overlayWidth)\\n            .height(overlayHeight)\\n            .testTag(\\\"realtime_histogram_overlay_card\\\")\\n            .clip(RoundedCornerShape(8.dp)),\\n        colors = CardDefaults.cardColors(containerColor = Color(0xEB0A0E17)),\\n        shape = RoundedCornerShape(8.dp),\\n        border = CardDefaults.outlinedCardBorder().copy(\\n            brush = androidx.compose.ui.graphics.SolidColor(Color(0xFF263248))\\n        )\\n    ) {\\n        Column(\\n            modifier = Modifier\\n                .fillMaxSize()\\n                .padding(horizontal = 6.dp, vertical = 4.dp)\\n        ) {\\n            // ==========================================\\n            // 1. SCOPE HUD HEADER\\n            // ==========================================\\n            Row(\\n                verticalAlignment = Alignment.CenterVertically,\\n                horizontalArrangement = Arrangement.SpaceBetween,\\n                modifier = Modifier.fillMaxWidth()\\n            ) {\\n                Row(verticalAlignment = Alignment.CenterVertically) {\\n                    Box(\\n                        modifier = Modifier\\n                            .size(6.dp)\\n                            .clip(CircleShape)\\n                            .background(if (inspectRawLog) ResolveCyan else ResolveAmber)\\n                    )\\n                    Spacer(modifier = Modifier.width(4.dp))\\n                    Text(\\n                        text = if (inspectRawLog) \\\"HISTO \342\200\242 S24 LOG\\\" else \\\"HISTO \342\200\242 REC.709\\\",\\n                        color = if (inspectRawLog) ResolveCyan else ResolveAmber,\\n                        fontSize = 8.5.sp,\\n                        fontWeight = FontWeight.Black,\\n                        fontFamily = FontFamily.Monospace,\\n                        letterSpacing = 0.5.sp\\n                    )\\n                }\\n\\n                Row(verticalAlignment = Alignment.CenterVertically) {\\n                    // Mode Toggle: LUMA / RGB / COMBINED\\n                    Surface(\\n                        onClick = {\\n                            displayMode = when (displayMode) {\\n                                HistogramDisplayMode.COMBINED -> HistogramDisplayMode.LUMINANCE\\n                                HistogramDisplayMode.LUMINANCE -> HistogramDisplayMode.RGB_PARADE\\n                                HistogramDisplayMode.RGB_PARADE -> HistogramDisplayMode.COMBINED\\n                            }\\n                        },\\n                        color = Color(0xFF161F2E),\\n                        shape = RoundedCornerShape(3.dp),\\n                        modifier = Modifier.height(18.dp).testTag(\\\"histogram_mode_toggle_pill\\\")\\n                    ) {\\n                        Text(\\n                            text = when (displayMode) {\\n                                HistogramDisplayMode.COMBINED -> \\\"ALL\\\"\\n                                HistogramDisplayMode.LUMINANCE -> \\\"LUM\\\"\\n                                HistogramDisplayMode.RGB_PARADE -> \\\"RGB\\\"\\n                            },\\n                            color = TextSecondary,\\n                            fontSize = 7.5.sp,\\n                            fontWeight = FontWeight.Bold,\\n                            fontFamily = FontFamily.Monospace,\\n                            modifier = Modifier.padding(horizontal = 4.dp, vertical = 2.dp)\\n                        )\\n                    }\\n\\n                    Spacer(modifier = Modifier.width(3.dp))\\n\\n                    // Size Expand/Contract Button\\n                    IconButton(\\n                        onClick = { isExpanded = !isExpanded },\\n                        modifier = Modifier.size(18.dp).testTag(\\\"histogram_expand_button\\\")\\n                    ) {\\n                        Icon(\\n                            imageVector = if (isExpanded) Icons.Default.CloseFullscreen else Icons.Default.OpenInFull,\\n                            contentDescription = \\\"Resize Histogram Scope\\\",\\n                            tint = TextMuted,\\n                            modifier = Modifier.size(11.dp)\\n                        )\\n                    }\\n\\n                    // Close Button\\n                    IconButton(\\n                        onClick = onClose,\\n                        modifier = Modifier.size(18.dp).testTag(\\\"close_histogram_overlay_button\\\")\\n                    ) {\\n                        Icon(\\n                            imageVector = Icons.Default.Close,\\n                            contentDescription = \\\"Close Histogram Scope\\\",\\n                            tint = TextMuted,\\n                            modifier = Modifier.size(11.dp)\\n                        )\\n                    }\\n                }\\n            }\\n\\n            // ==========================================\\n            // 2. REAL-TIME 256-BIN GRAPH CANAVAS\\n            // ==========================================\\n            Box(\\n                modifier = Modifier\\n                    .fillMaxWidth()\\n                    .weight(1f)\\n                    .clip(RoundedCornerShape(4.dp))\\n                    .background(Color(0xFF070A10))\\n                    .border(0.5.dp, Color(0xFF1E2838), RoundedCornerShape(4.dp))\\n            ) {\\n                Canvas(modifier = Modifier.fillMaxSize().padding(horizontal = 2.dp, vertical = 2.dp)) {\\n                    val w = size.width\\n                    val h = size.height\\n\\n                    // 1. IRE Graticule Grid Lines (0%, 18% Mid-Gray, 50%, 75%, 100%)\\n                    val gridFractions = floatArrayOf(0.18f, 0.50f, 0.75f)\\n                    for (frac in gridFractions) {\\n                        val gx = frac * w\\n                        drawLine(\\n                            color = if (frac == 0.18f) ResolveGreen.copy(alpha = 0.35f) else Color(0xFF1E2838),\\n                            start = Offset(gx, 0f),\\n                            end = Offset(gx, h),\\n                            strokeWidth = 1.dp.toPx(),\\n                            pathEffect = if (frac == 0.18f) PathEffect.dashPathEffect(floatArrayOf(4f, 4f)) else null\\n                        )\\n                    }\\n\\n                    // Max bin sample count for auto-scaling\\n                    var maxCount = 1\\n                    for (i in 0..255) {\\n                        if (displayMode == HistogramDisplayMode.LUMINANCE) {\\n                            maxCount = maxOf(maxCount, histogram.lumBins[i])\\n                        } else {\\n                            maxCount = maxOf(\\n                                maxCount,\\n                                histogram.redBins[i],\\n                                histogram.greenBins[i],\\n                                histogram.blueBins[i],\\n                                histogram.lumBins[i]\\n                            )\\n                        }\\n                    }\\n\\n                    // 2. Render Luminance (if LUMA or COMBINED)\\n                    if (displayMode == HistogramDisplayMode.LUMINANCE || displayMode == HistogramDisplayMode.COMBINED) {\\n                        val lumPath = Path()\\n                        lumPath.moveTo(0f, h)\\n                        for (i in 0..255) {\\n                            val x = (i / 255f) * w\\n                            val normH = (histogram.lumBins[i].toFloat() / maxCount) * h * 0.94f\\n                            lumPath.lineTo(x, h - normH)\\n                        }\\n                        lumPath.lineTo(w, h)\\n                        lumPath.close()\\n\\n                        // Gradient fill under luminance curve\\n                        drawPath(\\n                            path = lumPath,\\n                            brush = Brush.verticalGradient(\\n                                listOf(\\n                                    Color.White.copy(alpha = if (displayMode == HistogramDisplayMode.LUMINANCE) 0.35f else 0.12f),\\n                                    Color.White.copy(alpha = 0.02f)\\n                                )\\n                            )\\n                        )\\n                        // Stroke line\\n                        drawPath(\\n                            path = lumPath,\\n                            color = Color.White.copy(alpha = if (displayMode == HistogramDisplayMode.LUMINANCE) 0.9f else 0.5f),\\n                            style = Stroke(width = 1.2.dp.toPx())\\n                        )\\n                    }\\n\\n                    // 3. Render RGB Channels (if RGB_PARADE or COMBINED)\\n                    if (displayMode == HistogramDisplayMode.RGB_PARADE || displayMode == HistogramDisplayMode.COMBINED) {\\n                        val channels = listOf(\\n                            Pair(histogram.redBins, Color(0xFFEF4444)),\\n                            Pair(histogram.greenBins, Color(0xFF10B981)),\\n                            Pair(histogram.blueBins, Color(0xFF38BDF8))\\n                        )\\n\\n                        for ((bins, channelColor) in channels) {\\n                            val path = Path()\\n                            path.moveTo(0f, h)\\n                            for (i in 0..255) {\\n                                val x = (i / 255f) * w\\n                                val normH = (bins[i].toFloat() / maxCount) * h * 0.90f\\n                                path.lineTo(x, h - normH)\\n                            }\\n                            path.lineTo(w, h)\\n                            path.close()\\n\\n                            drawPath(\\n                                path = path,\\n                                color = channelColor.copy(alpha = 0.15f)\\n                            )\\n                            drawPath(\\n                                path = path,\\n                                color = channelColor.copy(alpha = 0.85f),\\n                                style = Stroke(width = 1.dp.toPx())\\n                            )\\n                        }\\n                    }\\n\\n                    // 4. Crushed Black (0 IRE) alert line\\n                    if (histogram.shadowClipPct > 1.0f) {\\n                        drawLine(\\n                            color = Color(0xFFEF4444),\\n                            start = Offset(1.5f, 0f),\\n                            end = Offset(1.5f, h),\\n                            strokeWidth = 3.dp.toPx()\\n                        )\\n                    }\\n\\n                    // 5. Blown White (100 IRE) alert line\\n                    if (histogram.highlightClipPct > 1.0f) {\\n                        drawLine(\\n                            color = Color(0xFFEF4444),\\n                            start = Offset(w - 1.5f, 0f),\\n                            end = Offset(w - 1.5f, h),\\n                            strokeWidth = 3.dp.toPx()\\n                        )\\n                    }\\n                }\\n            }\\n\\n            Spacer(modifier = Modifier.height(2.dp))\\n\\n            // ==========================================\\n            // 3. TELEMETRY & CLIPPING STATUS BAR\\n            // ==========================================\\n            Row(\\n                verticalAlignment = Alignment.CenterVertically,\\n                horizontalArrangement = Arrangement.SpaceBetween,\\n                modifier = Modifier.fillMaxWidth()\\n            ) {\\n                // Exposure Level / Mean IRE\\n                Text(\\n                    text = \\\"EXP ${(histogram.avgLum / 255f * 100).toInt()}%\\\",\\n                    color = TextSecondary,\\n                    fontSize = 7.5.sp,\\n                    fontFamily = FontFamily.Monospace,\\n                    fontWeight = FontWeight.Bold\\n                )\\n\\n                // Clipping Status Indicator\\n                when {\\n                    histogram.shadowClipPct > 1.5f && histogram.highlightClipPct > 1.5f -> {\\n                        Text(\\n                            text = \\\"CRUSH & BLOWN\\\",\\n                            color = Color(0xFFEF4444),\\n                            fontSize = 7.5.sp,\\n                            fontWeight = FontWeight.Black,\\n                            fontFamily = FontFamily.Monospace\\n                        )\\n                    }\\n                    histogram.shadowClipPct > 1.5f -> {\\n                        Text(\\n                            text = \\\"SHADOW CRUSH ${histogram.shadowClipPct.toInt()}%\\\",\\n                            color = Color(0xFFEF4444),\\n                            fontSize = 7.5.sp,\\n                            fontWeight = FontWeight.Bold,\\n                            fontFamily = FontFamily.Monospace\\n                        )\\n                    }\\n                    histogram.highlightClipPct > 1.5f -> {\\n                        Text(\\n                            text = \\\"HIGHLIGHT CLIP ${histogram.highlightClipPct.toInt()}%\\\",\\n                            color = Color(0xFFEF4444),\\n                            fontSize = 7.5.sp,\\n                            fontWeight = FontWeight.Bold,\\n                            fontFamily = FontFamily.Monospace\\n                        )\\n                    }\\n                    else -> {\\n                        Text(\\n                            text = \\\"DYNAMIC RANGE OK\\\",\\n                            color = ResolveGreen,\\n                            fontSize = 7.5.sp,\\n                            fontWeight = FontWeight.Bold,\\n                            fontFamily = FontFamily.Monospace\\n                        )\\n                    }\\n                }\\n\\n                // Log vs Graded source switch pill\\n                if (rawBitmap != null) {\\n                    Text(\\n                        text = if (inspectRawLog) \\\"[RAW]\\\" else \\\"[REC]\\\",\\n                        color = if (inspectRawLog) ResolveCyan else ResolveAmber,\\n                        fontSize = 7.5.sp,\\n                        fontFamily = FontFamily.Monospace,\\n                        fontWeight = FontWeight.Bold,\\n                        modifier = Modifier\\n                            .clickable { inspectRawLog = !inspectRawLog }\\n                            .padding(1.dp)\\n                    )\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\",\"Description\":\"Create real-time Histogram Scope Overlay component for Samsung S24 Log footage\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"TargetFile\":\"/app/src/main/java/com/example/ui/components/RealtimeHistogramOverlay.kt\",\"toolAction\":\"Creating RealtimeHistogramOverlay\",\"toolSummary\":\"Create RealtimeHistogramOverlay.kt\"}"
