  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Adding Histogram Overlay**\n\nOkay, I\'m integrating a histogram overlay toggle into the video player. I\'ve added the `showHistogramOverlay` boolean and `onToggleHistogramOverlay` function to `VideoPlayerView`. I\'m also adding the button itself to the top bar, next to the false color and split-screen toggles.\n\n\n**Implementing Overlay Visuals**\n\nI\'ve just added the histogram overlay toggle button to the UI, complete with the appropriate icon and state coloring. The functionality is linked up to `onToggleHistogramOverlay`, so it correctly updates the `showHistogramOverlay` state. I have added the histogram overlay HUD inside the `Main Video Surface Box`. The overlay can now be displayed based on the `showHistogramOverlay` boolean.\n\n\n"
