  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Developing Test Strategy**\n\nI\'m focusing on crafting a test for the real-time histogram calculation. I\'m starting with a bitmap of 100x100 pixels, using the ARGB_8888 configuration. My plan is to validate the histogram generation from that bitmap using the new unit test.\n\n\n**Implementing Test Logic**\n\nI\'ve integrated a new test case into `ExampleUnitTest.kt` to validate histogram calculations. I created a bitmap with half crushed black pixels and half mid-gray pixels. The test verifies histogram bin sizes, sample count, and specific clipping percentages for shadow and highlight, ensuring the average luminance falls within the expected range.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_238171"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false,\"Description\":\"Add unit test for real-time histogram calculation\",\"EndLine\":445,\"Instruction\":\"Add testRealtimeHistogramCalculation\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"        // Velvia should have punchier saturation than Astia\\n        val (vr, _, vb) = SamsungLogColorScience.applyLutPreset(0.7f, 0.4f, 0.2f, LutPreset.FUJI_VELVIA)\\n        val (asr, _, asb) = SamsungLogColorScience.applyLutPreset(0.7f, 0.4f, 0.2f, LutPreset.FUJI_ASTIA)\\n        assertTrue(\\\"Velvia red saturation punch\\\", (vr - vb) > (asr - asb))\\n    }\\n\\n    @Test\\n    fun testRealtimeHistogramCalculation() {\\n        val bmp = android.graphics.Bitmap.createBitmap(100, 100, android.graphics.Bitmap.Config.ARGB_8888)\\n        for (y in 0 until 100) {\\n            for (x in 0 until 100) {\\n                val color = if (x < 50) {\\n                    (0xFF shl 24) or (0 shl 16) or (0 shl 8) or 0\\n                } else {\\n                    (0xFF shl 24) or (118 shl 16) or (118 shl 8) or 118\\n                }\\n                bmp.setPixel(x, y, color)\\n            }\\n        }\\n\\n        val histo = SamsungLogColorScience.calculateHistogram(bmp)\\n        assertEquals(256, histo.lumBins.size)\\n        assertEquals(256, histo.redBins.size)\\n        assertEquals(256, histo.greenBins.size)\\n        assertEquals(256, histo.blueBins.size)\\n        assertTrue(histo.totalSamples > 0)\\n        assertTrue(\\\"Shadow crush should be detected\\\", histo.shadowClipPct > 30f)\\n        assertEquals(0f, histo.highlightClipPct, 0.01f)\\n        assertTrue(histo.avgLum in 40f..70f)\\n    }\\n}\",\"StartLine\":439,\"TargetContent\":\"        // Velvia should have punchier saturation than Astia\\n        val (vr, _, vb) = SamsungLogColorScience.applyLutPreset(0.7f, 0.4f, 0.2f, LutPreset.FUJI_VELVIA)\\n        val (asr, _, asb) = SamsungLogColorScience.applyLutPreset(0.7f, 0.4f, 0.2f, LutPreset.FUJI_ASTIA)\\n        assertTrue(\\\"Velvia red saturation punch\\\", (vr - vb) > (asr - asb))\\n    }\\n}\",\"TargetFile\":\"/app/src/test/java/com/example/ExampleUnitTest.kt\",\"toolAction\":\"Adding testRealtimeHistogramCalculation\",\"toolSummary\":\"Add testRealtimeHistogramCalculation in ExampleUnitTest.kt\"}"
