  planner_response {
    response: "### Real-Time Histogram Scope Overlay Implemented\n\nA cinema-monitor-style **Real-Time Histogram Scope Overlay** (`RealtimeHistogramOverlay.kt`) has been integrated directly into the video viewport to monitor the tonal and luminance distribution of imported Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra 4K Log and graded footage.\n\n---\n\n### Key Capabilities\n\n1. **256-Bin Luminance & RGB Channel Distribution**:\n   - Calculates 256-bin density distributions in real time with hardware-accelerated anti-aliased B\303\251zier paths and gradient fills.\n   - **Mode Switcher** (`ALL` / `LUM` / `RGB`): Toggle between master luminance only, RGB channels overlay, or all channels simultaneously.\n   - **Flat Log vs Graded Rec.709 A/B Switch**: Toggle between `[RAW]` (flat Samsung S24 Log) and `[REC]` (graded Rec.709) directly on the HUD to immediately observe dynamic range expansion.\n\n2. **Standard Reference IRE Graticules**:\n   - **0% IRE**: Crushed black floor detection.\n   - **18% Middle Gray**: Dashed reference line aligned at standard midtone exposure zone (~40\342\200\22345% IRE).\n   - **75% IRE**: Highlight skin tone roll-off reference.\n   - **100% IRE**: Specular highlight ceiling.\n\n3. **Dynamic Range & Clipping Warning System**:\n   - **`SHADOW CRUSH` Alert**: Turns bright red along the left edge whenever black floor crush exceeds 1.5%.\n   - **`HIGHLIGHT CLIP` Alert**: Turns bright red along the right edge whenever specular blowout exceeds 1.5%.\n   - **`DYNAMIC RANGE OK`**: Green status badge confirming legal, broadcast-safe tonal retention.\n   - **Mean Exposure Percentage**: Continuous numerical readout (`EXP 48%`).\n\n4. **On-Screen HUD Controls**:\n   - **Quick Toggle**: Tapped directly via the new Equalizer icon (`Icons.Default.Equalizer`, `testTag=\"histogram_overlay_toggle\"`) in the video playback toolbar or through the top bar\'s 3-dots **Studio More Options** menu.\n   - **HUD Resize Button**: Expand from compact PIP mode ($170\\text{ dp} \\times 95\\text{ dp}$) to inspection mode ($250\\text{ dp} \\times 140\\text{ dp}$).\n   - **Dismissal**: Instant close via the HUD\'s top-right `\342\234\225` button or the player toolbar icon."
    modified_response: "### Real-Time Histogram Scope Overlay Implemented\n\nA cinema-monitor-style **Real-Time Histogram Scope Overlay** (`RealtimeHistogramOverlay.kt`) has been integrated directly into the video viewport to monitor the tonal and luminance distribution of imported Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra 4K Log and graded footage.\n\n---\n\n### Key Capabilities\n\n1. **256-Bin Luminance & RGB Channel Distribution**:\n   - Calculates 256-bin density distributions in real time with hardware-accelerated anti-aliased B\303\251zier paths and gradient fills.\n   - **Mode Switcher** (`ALL` / `LUM` / `RGB`): Toggle between master luminance only, RGB channels overlay, or all channels simultaneously.\n   - **Flat Log vs Graded Rec.709 A/B Switch**: Toggle between `[RAW]` (flat Samsung S24 Log) and `[REC]` (graded Rec.709) directly on the HUD to immediately observe dynamic range expansion.\n\n2. **Standard Reference IRE Graticules**:\n   - **0% IRE**: Crushed black floor detection.\n   - **18% Middle Gray**: Dashed reference line aligned at standard midtone exposure zone (~40\342\200\22345% IRE).\n   - **75% IRE**: Highlight skin tone roll-off reference.\n   - **100% IRE**: Specular highlight ceiling.\n\n3. **Dynamic Range & Clipping Warning System**:\n   - **`SHADOW CRUSH` Alert**: Turns bright red along the left edge whenever black floor crush exceeds 1.5%.\n   - **`HIGHLIGHT CLIP` Alert**: Turns bright red along the right edge whenever specular blowout exceeds 1.5%.\n   - **`DYNAMIC RANGE OK`**: Green status badge confirming legal, broadcast-safe tonal retention.\n   - **Mean Exposure Percentage**: Continuous numerical readout (`EXP 48%`).\n\n4. **On-Screen HUD Controls**:\n   - **Quick Toggle**: Tapped directly via the new Equalizer icon (`Icons.Default.Equalizer`, `testTag=\"histogram_overlay_toggle\"`) in the video playback toolbar or through the top bar\'s 3-dots **Studio More Options** menu.\n   - **HUD Resize Button**: Expand from compact PIP mode ($170\\text{ dp} \\times 95\\text{ dp}$) to inspection mode ($250\\text{ dp} \\times 140\\text{ dp}$).\n   - **Dismissal**: Instant close via the HUD\'s top-right `\342\234\225` button or the player toolbar icon."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
    thinking_signature: "\022\266\002\n\263\002\001i\024}\023Q\024\217\307\v\\\260\304\335\336\362\034\336\344v\353\303\370\000}\336\000T\023\273\274\276\212\005\352\016^,\232\327\322Q9C\213\227_\365 \366\360\265\2116\025\270?&\276\361\372\321\326\363i\212>\265^\216\237\215\260\254\323\241`\006\340J\355\033yTK\020\225\306_\206 jO|\305\272X\006@\204D[\352\004\301\254\354CV\206\2337/\"@\226\210x\345ez\251R\227J}\017` M\257\001\362\372z6\256r2+\312D\v\251\356\"\016\024\256\264\367Vb\200\022r[\307%\034\360\346\372\177;\257\324\000\330\215\212\2639t\'\032\021^\350\231-K\226\356DU\3136\245\334s\267L\002\336\322\v$\ts\232\342\346\"tu\302x\302n\037\"\277\321\265X\307$`\226\225\003zk\327\264)\377\347\350\300\315I]\257\3163w\033\301\313\327\271iw8H\026\200\332\342,\232r\026iE\370\222\251g\336\304U\355[\355+\271\r6\021n\200h\314n\204:hZ\260!\331\201VD\177\241D\032\272o3\356Yu\260C\352*\030\377dz\255\032"
